-- QuestLocFlavor (generado 2026-10-17): objetivos completos, con dialogos, solo para narrar.
_G.QuestLocFlavor = _G.QuestLocFlavor or {}
QuestLocFlavor[29] = {
[14501]={"Merilien is located on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should bring the wedding supply crates to Merilien.","Wedding Supplies","Collect wedding supply crates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'A perfect wedding can be the most memorable moment of a relationship. I ensure that for all of my events, that memory is a delightful and fond one. Only the best will do, which is why I have shipments of the finest supplies coming in from across the land. Rare foods, exquisite silks, exotic flowers – my couples ask and I deliver!\
\
'Well, someone else was supposed to deliver my shipments, but they seem to be otherwise occupied. If you happen to find your way down to the Third Circle, and if you happened to gather my tardy supply crates whilst there, I would appreciate it. You shall know which boxes are mine by their quality, of course.'","'Ah, excellent. Good work!'","Collected wedding supply crates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The wedding planner in Minas Tirith seeks assistance retrieving a crate of event supplies.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Deliver the crates to Merilien","Wedding supply crates can be found on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
The wedding planner has asked you to retrieve wayward supply crates needed for her events.","'Have you collected my supplies?'"},
[14502]={"Breniriel has asked you to pull any invasive weeds you find in Edhellond.","Weeds pulled (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Mae govannen. Have you seen these weeds around Edhellond?' Breniriel holds up a fistful of what appears to be a bristly plant. 'I have studied many native plants, and not once have I ever seen one similar to this. Neither animal nor pest will eat the weeds, and they steal the resources that our garden requires. Doubtless the seeds accompanied the Corsairs on their long voyage here.\
\
'If Cellineth's new flowers are to thrive, then I must uproot every weed here.\
\
'Will you help me?'","'Now Cellineth's flowers have a better chance at survival. That is more than enough for me.' \
\
Breniriel offers a faint smile. \
\
'Thank you.'","You have pulled all the weeds you could find.\
\
You should talk to Breniriel in Edhellond.","Weed Invasion","Traces of the Corsairs' occupation of Edhellond persist in the form of an invasive plant.","Talk to Breniriel","Pull invasive weeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14503]={"Los rondadores de la arena se pueden encontrar en el Barandalf, al sur del Coloso.\
\
Herthdúr te ha pedido que busques montones de algas mojadas en los rondadores de la arena del Barandalf.","'Nunca tenemos suficientes cataplasmas, porque nunca tenemos suficientes suministros. Estas algas podrían ayudar mucho.'","'Estas servirán perfectamente. Apenas digeridas, y hay suficientes para hacer cataplasmas durante semanas. Gracias.'","Herthdúr está en el Coloso, al norte del Barandalf.\
\
Herthdúr estará ansioso por comenzar a preparar cataplasmas con las algas que has recogido.","Lleva las algas a Herthdúr","Consigue montones de algas mojadas de los rondadores de la arena (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pareece que cuando los rondadores de la arena digieren las algas del río en la parte alta del Baranduin, les confiere a las plantas una ligera capacidad de curación.","Algas del río","'Examiné las algas que has encontrado, y me alegro de que me las hayas traído. Normalmente, las algas del río no son muy interesantes. Se pueden comer si se tiene suficiente hambre, pero en sí mismas no tienen nada de especial.\
\
'Parece que algo sucede cuando los rondadores de la arena comienzan a digerir las algas. De alguna manera, hacen que las plantas adquieran una ligera capacidad de curación. Las he probado en varios compañeros del campamento con rasguños y cortes y los resultados son innegables.\
\
'No tiene sentido ir a nadar para conseguir más, ya que no estarán digeridas. Necesito que salgas y consigas más de los rondadores de la arena. Es una proposición un poco desagradable, lo sé, tomar la cena justo después de haber sido devorada, pero me gustaría tener más de estas algas para hacer algunos cataplasmas muy necesarios.'","Montones de algas mojadas conseguidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14504]={"Complete Allegiance quests in Udûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Complete Allegiance quests in Lhingris (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completed Allegiance quests in Udûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Conquest of Gorgoroth thanks you for you aid, adventurer. Take this as a token of our gratitude.'","Completed Allegiance quests in Talath Úrui (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, just who I wanted to see.\
\
'We're overloaded with requests for aid from our allies in Gorgoroth. Right now, the best way for you to help is to get down there and start fixing their problems for them. Check the Bounty Board to see what needs doing.'","Expedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls.\
\
You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.","'Hello again! Ready to help? \
\
'There are many things that need doing out there in Gorgoroth. A huge amount of things! Right now, we really just need you to go out there, and do what needs doing! Check the Bounty Board to see what there is to do.'","Complete Allegiance quests in Agarnaith (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to your Expedition Organizer","Completed Allegiance quests in Agarnaith (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Allegiance quests can be found on Bounty Boards in Gorgoroth and Allegiance Halls.\
\
You should complete five Allegiance quests in each Region of Gorgoroth.","Complete Allegiance quests in Talath Úrui (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hail, ${PLAYER}. Gondor is in need of your services once more.\
\
'We're receiving more and more requests for aid in the regions of Gorgoroth, and I want you to go and do what you can to help in the field. There's no sense in letting the enemy gain a foothold now that we've come this far! Check the Bounty Board for work.'","There is much to do for the Conquest of Gorgoroth to succeed. This week, you should focus your efforts on Allegiance quests.","'${PLAYER}, you are just in time.\
\
'Our allies in Gorgoroth are struggling to keep control of the region. They need assistance in the field, and I can think of no one better to send than you. Check the Bounty Board to see who has requested aid.'","Completed Allegiance quests in Dor Amarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Weekly Conquest: Allegiance Quests","Complete Allegiance quests in Dor Amarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completed Allegiance quests in Lhingris (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14505]={"Complete Dungeons of Naerband - Tier 2","Talk to your Expedition Organizer","'The Conquest of Gorgoroth thanks you for you aid, adventurer. Take this as a token of our gratitude.'","'Hello, friend! I hope you're ready for this!\
\
'I have a dangerous mission for you this time. So dangerous you won't be able to go it alone! The deepest, darkest places of Mordor have opened, just awaiting the bravest adventurers to plunge into their depths. So, what do you say?'","There is much to do for the Conquest of Gorgoroth to succeed. This week, you should focus your efforts on group instances.","Complete Dungeons of Naerband","Complete Court of Seregost - Tier 2","'${PLAYER}, our time is at hand!\
\
'Rally your companions, and be ready to head out at a moment's notice. Your orders are to infiltrate the strongholds of Mordor and do strategic damage. This will be a dangerous mission. Prepare yourselves.'","'${PLAYER}, the time has come!\
\
'The Conquest of Gorgoroth needs a group of adventurers to strike out at the head of the beast! The most dangerous places in Mordor are calling, and you had best prepare yourself!'","Complete Court of Seregost","Group instances can be entered through the Instance Finder.\
\
You should complete group instances in Gorgoroth.","'${PLAYER}, the time is at hand to take the fight to the enemy.\
\
'Rally your companions, and be ready to enter the most dangerous places in Mordor. Be brave, and be safe, my friend.'","Expedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls.\
\
You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.","Weekly Conquest: Group Instances"},
[14508]={"Recoge los pedidos semanales de carne fuera de las casas en Clegur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Bien, bien, muy bien.\
\
'Espera... ¿dónde está el pedido del alcalde Malmadog? Ah, a veces se olvida de colocar su pedido, ¡pero eso no significa que vaya a entender si no le envío los filetes que espera!\
\
'Mejor habla con el alcalde en persona. Luego vuelve aquí y dime qué es lo que quiere.'","'A veces el alcalde se olvida de colocar su pedido, ¡pero eso no significa que vaya a entender si no le envío los filetes que espera!\
\
'Mejor habla con el alcalde Malmadog en persona. Luego vuelve aquí y dime qué es lo que quiere.'","'¿Cunedda quiere saber qué carne deseo pedir para la próxima semana? ¡Seguro que ya debería saber que espero tener un pedido fijo: carne vacuna, pollo y cerdo, con abundancia de cada uno! ¡A Malmadog le encantan todos!'\
\
El alcalde nota tu expresión y suelta una carcajada sonora\
\
'Sí, me gustan todos, pero no hablo solo de mí. Mi buen muchacho aquí presente comparte mi nombre y mi apetito: ambos somos Malmadog.\
\
'Ahora ve y dile a Cunedda que quiero el mismo pedido que la semana pasada y que no debería ser necesario consultar a los alcaldes cada siete días. Después de todo, ¡estoy muy ocupado!'","'Ahora ve y dile a Cunedda que quiero el mismo pedido que la semana pasada y que no debería ser necesario consultar a los alcaldes cada siete días. Después de todo, ¡estoy muy ocupado!'","Pedidos semanales de carne recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cunedda Moltgig está dentro de su tienda en la aldea de Clegur.","Lleva los pedidos semanales de carne a Cunedda Moltgig en su tienda","Cunedda Moltgig necesita los pedidos semanales de carne de los habitantes de Clegur.","El alcalde Malmadog Torlan está afuera de su casa, al sur de Clegur.","'¿Crees que podrías recorrer Clegur y recoger los pedidos por mí? Deberían estar colocados fuera de las casas de mis vecinos, aunque a veces el viento se los lleva y arma algún lío.\
\
'Tendrás mi agradecimiento si lo haces. ¡No debería llevarte mucho tiempo!'","Habla con Cunedda Moltgig en su tienda","'Entonces, ¿qué quiere el alcalde para su entrega de carne la próxima semana? ¿Lo mismo que la vez pasada?\
\
'Siempre es lo mismo, sabes, pero si no se lo pregunto se queja de que no lo hice. Creo que al alcalde simplemente le gusta la atención. Siempre dice que está muy ocupado, pero siempre está ahí parado en su porche con su perro, tomando el sol.\
\
'Algún día de estos debería tomarme unas vacaciones. Quizá podría ser alcalde, ¡y entonces tendría más que suficiente tiempo para relajarme!'","Los pedidos semanales de carne de Cunedda Moltgig pueden encontrarse fuera de las casas de sus vecinos en la aldea de Clegur.","Pedidos Semanales","'¿Qué día es hoy? ¿Estás seguro? ¡Eso no puede ser correcto!\
\
'Verás, recojo los pedidos de mis vecinos para saber qué cortes de carne desean comprar para la próxima semana, ¡pero ya estoy retrasado y ahora no puedo dedicarle tiempo! ¿Crees que podrías recorrer Clegur y recoger los pedidos por mí? Deberían estar colocados fuera de las casas de mis vecinos, aunque a veces el viento se los lleva y arma algún lío.\
\
'Tendrás mi agradecimiento si lo haces. ¡No debería llevarte mucho tiempo!'","Habla con el Alcalde Malmadog Torlan en Clegur"},
[14517]={"Welcome to Harwick","'Let us end this nonsense now! I have had enough of Harding's mistrust of you, ${PLAYER}, when you have given us everything.\
\
'Come, I will insist that a council be called. Go to the Mead Hall, and I will meet you there. If Harding permits this council, the guard will see you in.\
\
'It is time to set things right!'","Talk to Harding","Harding has called a meeting in the Mead Hall of Harwick, and awaits your arrival.","'You have helped make Harwick's surrounding territory safer for its people. For that, you have my thanks. I think Harwick will be able to hold its own for now.'","In your last visit with Harding, he was not sure he could trust you, and was frustrated at the timing of your meeting. Since then you have done a service to Harwick and should have a more favourable meeting this time around.","'Come with me, ${PLAYER}. No one will dare arrest you if I am by your side. I will request an audience with Harding immediately.'","Captain Agelmund is eager to take you for another meeting with the Thane of Harwick, Reeve of the Wold and Aldor of the Eastemnet.\
\
You should speak with Captain Agelmund to travel to Harwick for a meeting with Harding.","Meet Cíllan at the Mead Hall for an audience with Harding"},
[14518]={"Locate Hytbold's Norcrofts District","The various sections of Hytbold are spread throughout the ruined town.\
\
Edgal has asked you to take a quick look around the burned-out town of Hytbold.","While the river now flows by unchecked, once repaired this mill will bring great use to Hytbold","The Mead Hall of Hytbold is a large, impressive structure. There is much to be done to restore its glory, however","Welcome to Hytbold","Locate Hytbold's Farms","Locate Hytbold's Smithy","Locate Hytbold's Wold District","Locate Hytbold's Lumbermill","Locate Hytbold's Sutcrofts District","Locate Hytbold's Entwash District","'As you can see, good ${RACE}, there is much to do here. The forces of the Enemy have wrought much destruction. It is up to us to rally the Eastemnet and show them the will and spirit of the Rohirrim.'","While they are not scholars, the Rohirrim know the power and value of knowledge. This place was once that and can be again","Edgal is waiting at the Mead Hall in Hytbold.\
\
You should return to Edgal and speak to him about beginning the repairs.","The people of the Wold build strong defences. They will be a great boon to Hytbold if they return","'I am glad to see that you found your way here, ${PLAYER}. There is a great deal of work to do if we are to call this a town of Rohan. I believe the people of the Eastemnet will rally to aid you, but the effort will be great. They have plenty of concerns of their own to focus upon.\
\
'There are nine main areas to this town. The Mead Hall is nestled up near the cliffs with the Study, Smithy, and Armoury tucked behind it. Below that are areas for the inhabitants of each of the four eastern Ridings. To the north-west of the walls are a few farmsteads, while on the south is the remains of a lumber-mill and water-wheel.\
\
'Before we get started on the repairs, I encourage you to take a quick look around and familiarize yourself with the town. My hope is that you will be able to help us transform this place and that it will not look as it does for very long.'","The people of the Sutcrofts are experts at farming and assaulting the enemy. They will empower any town to outlast and destroy its enemies","Edgal has asked you to take a quick walk around Hytbold to assess the current state of the town.","Locate Hytbold's Study","Enough of the structure remains that, with a little work, this smithy could be put back to good use","Talk to Edgal","The people of the Norcrofts are unrivalled in their command of horses. They will be needed to defend Hytbold to the last","The farmhouses escaped mostly unscathed, but the farm itself did not. Repairing these will be a priority if anyone is to return","Locate Hytbold's Mead Hall","The people of the Entwash are renowned for their tales and songs. They will not allow any town to forget its past"},
[14519]={"Welcome to Iridír","'Girhâzi will wish to speak to you. Continue south along this road and you will come to the village of Iridír. Go there and present yourself to her.'","Iridír is along the north bank of the Ikorbân River in Ambarûl. You should go there and meet Girhâzi.","This formidable-looking woman must be Girhâzi, the apparent leader of the people here in Ambarûl. With a curious look, she silently assesses you for several uncomfortable heartbeats.","Introduce yourself to Girhâzi","'Hold there!'\
\
The guard yells, eyeing you suspiciously.\
\
'From where do you come stranger, and what is your business in Ambarûl?'\
\
You tell her that you recently came from Umbar and your business is your own. She gazes at you while she carefully considers your answer.\
\
'Girhâzi will wish to speak to you. Continue south and you will come to the town of Iridír. There you will find Girhâzi. Think not of making trouble for the people in Ambarûl or death will swiftly find you. Iridír is well-guarded, and we do not hesitate to relieve our enemies of their heads. Go now.'","A guard along the road has directed you to the village of Iridír, where you have been told to go and present yourself to Girhâzi."},
[14521]={"Thormóth, líder del grupo de expedición de enanos que sostiene el Umbral de Durin, te ha pedido que ayudes a su gente a establecerse después de la prueba en la puerta.","Gamli y Ráthulf están en el Umbral de Durin. Athils está en el Ala Norte del Umbral de Durin: sube las escaleras, hacia el norte y luego hacia el oeste.\
\
Thormóth te ha pedido que hables con algunos de los enanos que tienen dificultades para establecerse en el Umbral de Durin.","'Deberías hablar con Gamli, Ráthulf y Athils, aquí en el Umbral de Durin.'","La bienvenida a Moria","Ayuda a Gamli","Ayuda a Ráthulf","Ayuda a Athils","'Gracias por todo lo que has hecho, ${PLAYER}. Sin duda, ahora estamos comenzando con un mejor pie aquí.'","'Te doy la bienvenida a Moria, ${PLAYER}. Llegas en un momento trascendental. Soy el jefe del grupo de expedición aquí en el Umbral de Durin. Otros grupos de expedición ya se han adentrado más en las profundidades de Khazad-dûm, con la esperanza de encontrar la expedición de Balin de hace algunos años y conocer su destino.\
\
'Mis compañeros enanos están teniendo dificultades para establecerse, por varias razones. Si pudieras ayudarlos, te estaría muy agradecido.'","Habla con Thormóth","Thormóth está en el Umbral de Durin.\
\
Habiendo prestado una mano amiga en este primer sitio de la expedición, ahora deberías regresar con su líder."},
[14522]={"Talk to Ingold","Ingold worries that provisions will run out during the expedition into Mordor and asks you to acquire meats in Dor Amarth for him.","Welcomed Provisions","Cook raw meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Store the cooked meats for Ingold","You should cook the raw meat at one of the burning fires nearby the Ruins of Díngarth.","Consigue carne (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Black goats and sûlokil can be found sparsely populating the plains and hills of Dor Amarth.\
\
You should gather meats from these beasts to help feed the conquest into Mordor.","Placed the cooked meats in a crate for curing","Collect cuts of cooked meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should bring the cooked meats back to the Ruins of Díngarth and store them away.","Ingold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","Gathered raw meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected cooked meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}, for cooking and storing the meats you have gathered. These rations should last us for some time.'","Gather meats","'If you have a moment, I must discuss something with you. Our provisions have begun to run low. We must not let hunger be the end of this expedition. I need anyone who is able to hunt the beasts that roam Dor Amarth. Lômazar has assured me that the dire-horns are edible and the sûlokil are rather good when cooked and seasoned.'"},
[14523]={"'¡Un mathom bien conservado! Se lo llevaré al Maestro Cocinero enseguida; es muy bueno catalogando los mathoms más pequeños, ¿sabes?'","Lleva el mathom bien conservado a Eustoma Riberalodosa","'¿Has encontrado ya algún mathom bien conservado, ${PLAYER}?'","'Hemos estado ocupados como abejas estos últimos días, organizando a los miembros de la Sociedad de los Mathoms y encontrando espacio para todos los nuevos mathoms que han estado llegando. Pronto, quizá tengamos que usar los viejos túneles de almacenamiento. Nunca habíamos tenido tanta actividad, y creo que es demasiado para algunos de los hobbits jóvenes. Escuché al joven Baldwin refunfuñando afuera porque tenía que encontrar un pollo asado con miel para la próxima reunión de la Sociedad de los Mathoms cuando debería haber estado etiquetando mathoms. ¡Algunos de estos hobbits parecen más interesados en el menú de la cena que en los maravillosos mathoms nuevos!\
\
'En fin, hemos descubierto que muchos de los mathoms no están en muy buen estado. No sé qué les habrá pasado... a decir verdad, ¡ni siquiera sé para qué sirven la mayoría! Lo que sí sé es que no están en condiciones de exhibirse. ¿Qué tendríamos para mostrar de todo nuestro arduo trabajo si no tenemos piezas de exposición?\
\
'Si encuentras mathoms bien conservados, asegúrate de tratarlos con cuidado al traerlos. Cuanto más intactos, mejor. Y al menos trata de limpiarlos un poco antes de dejarlos... algunos tenían unas cosas de lo más extrañas encima.'","Eustoma Riberalodosa está en la Casa de los Mathoms, en Cavada Grande, en la Comarca.\
\
Eustoma Riberalodosa te ha pedido que le lleves mathoms bien conservados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> Los mathoms bien conservados pueden obtenerse de Hombres, Enanos, orcos, trolls y Muertos de nivel 35 a 45 en todo el mundo.</rgb>","Eustoma Riberalodosa te dijo que la Sociedad de los Mathoms no tenía muchas piezas en condiciones de exhibición.","Mathoms Bien Conservados — Introducción","Recoge un mathom bien conservado","Mathom bien conservado recogido"},
[14524]={"'Encontrarás a Northrim y a su compañera, Cwendreda, en Dol Vaeg, una pequeña ruina cubierta de maleza al oeste de Ost Guruth. Están allí vigilando las ruinas de Nan Dhelu y Haragmar. Habla con Northrim y ayúdalo en lo que puedas.'","'Los vientres se limpiarán y la carne se curará y salará. Podré llenar nuestros barriles de agua y alimentar a mi gente.\
\
'Tienes mi agradecimiento.'","'¡Rápido ahora! Necesitaré piernas de carne y estómagos de jabalí. Necesitamos carne y mejores formas de llevar el agua de vuelta a Ost Guruth.'","Bien preparados","Northrim está en el campamento de los Eglain en Dol Vaeg, con vistas a Haragmar y Nan Dhelu.\
\
Stanric te envió con Northrim para completar más tareas necesarias para preparar a los Eglain para el sombrío futuro que les espera.","Recolecta carne de jabalí (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta estómago de jabalí (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Estómago de jabalí recolectado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Stanric es un buen hombre, y sus palabras son ciertas. Debemos prepararnos para el oscuro futuro que se avecina. Como te dirá mi compañera, Cwendreda, las ruinas de Nan Dhelu se han vuelto más oscuras que nunca.\
\
'Mi tarea es mundana, pero necesaria. Necesitamos odres de agua y comida, ya que trasladar a un gran número de personas de un lugar a otro puede llevar más tiempo del que tenemos para encontrar nuevas fuentes de agua y alimento.\
\
'Para hacer estos odres y alimentar a nuestra gente, necesitaremos una criatura intacta por la corrupción. Los jabalíes en estas tierras orientales servirán. Hay muchos jabalíes al este, a lo largo del camino, pero también algunas madrigueras donde las colinas se elevan al norte y al sur del camino.'","'Teníamos un corral de jabalíes, ahora cazados por orcos y arañas en el oeste y el sur. Frideric quiere lograr la paz y pide tan poco para alcanzarla. Nuestras reservas no durarán mucho, y necesitamos carne y agua pronto, o enfrentaremos la hambruna.\
\
'En el este, al norte del camino, encontrarás Dol Vaeg y un pequeño campamento de nuestra gente. Busca y habla con Northrim en ese campamento y ayúdalo con sus tareas. Debemos estar bien preparados para este nuevo futuro.'","Habla con Northrim en Dol Vaeg","Los jabalíes se encuentran hacia el este, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, que está al sur de Ost Guruth.\
\
Northrim te envió a recolectar piernas y estómagos de jabalí para ayudar a los Eglain a llenar sus reservas para el invierno.","Carne de jabalí recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva los estómagos y la carne de jabalí a Northrim en Dol Vaeg","A pesar de contar con un pequeño suministro de armas y armaduras, Stanric de los Eglain intenta organizar al menos una defensa mínima contra las bestias salvajes y peligrosas y otros enemigos que acechan las ruinas que los Eglain llaman su hogar."},
[14525]={"'Without their supplies, we may yet be able to drive the Nink-hai back to the mountain holes from whence they came!\
\
'Thank you again, ${PLAYER}.'","The Nink-hai Orc-tribe can be found south-west of Odda's tent.\
\
Odda has given you a torch which can be used to set fire to the supply-stores of the Orcs.","Burn Nink-hai supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Odda is concerned about the number of supplies being moved into the Nink-hai camp and from whence the supplies might be coming.","'These Orcs, the Nink-hai...there is more to them than meets the eye. You saw their swords yourself. Tell me, were they typical Orc-swords? Nay, I believe that weapons and supplies are being transported here from afar, through hidden passages under the Misty Mountains.\
\
'They have gathered great caches of tools and food in order to fortify themselves away from their caves. Their resources must be destroyed if we ever hope to drive them back.\
\
'Take this torch and set fire to their supply-store, then return to me once the deed is done.'","Talk to Odda at his tent","Odda can be found near the road south of the Cuthstan.\
\
The Orcs' supply-stores have been destroyed by your actions, and Odda is awaiting news of your success.","You are near a Nink-hai supply-store","Well-supplied","Burned Nink-hai supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14538]={"'I am so glad that you are willing to gather phials of water for my collection! I very much look forward to studying the samples you bring me, for there is much to be learned of a place from its still waters.'","Laidhriel is interested in collecting samples of water to keep for study upon her return to Lothlórien so that she can better understand the environs of Mirkwood's swamp-lands.","Laidhriel stands at the entrance to Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt.\
\
You should return to Laidhriel with the water-samples she requested of you.","Wetlands of Southern Mirkwood","Bring the phials to Laidhriel at Estolad Mernael","Samples of water can be collected throughout the many shallow pools of the Drownholt in Mirkwood.\
\
Laidhriel has asked you to wander among the pools of the Drownholt and collect several phials of water for her collection.","'How wonderful, ${PLAYER}! I think these will do very well for the purpose of my studies. I hope to learn much of Mirkwood from these drops, for they can tell me many long tales of the rain and the plants and the earth of these parts. I suspect these will be sad tales, but perhaps some helpful knowledge can be gleaned from them in time.'","'We are very busy here with planning our offensive, as you see. Unfortunately, this does not leave me with much opportunity to pursue my usual studies. I am a scholar of nature, you see, as are many of my kindred.\
\
'I have great interest in the natural world, even one as corrupted as this black forest. At home in Lórien I have a great collection of water-samples; it has taken me many long years to build. It would be a shame to leave the Drownholt without expanding my library.\
\
'You would be doing a great favour to me if you would take samples from pools in the Drownholt as you go thither. Such items would be worth more to me than gold, ${PLAYER}.'","Collect water-samples in the Drownholt (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected water-samples in the Drownholt (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14539]={"Merilien's ale barrels can be found in various taverns in Minas Tirith.\
\
The wedding planner has asked you to retrieve barrels of ale for her events.","'Oh yes, I have her shipment. You shall find it downstairs, in the kitchen. Just... mind yourself down there. This establishment is a rougher place than I am used to.'","'Ah, you must be here for Merilien's order. The barrel is just over there next to the M- er, next to Oli, as the hobbit lords named her. Just look for the tusks! You can't miss it.'","'Ah, excellent. Good work! While I am not fond of the brew myself, it is always in high demand for my events.'","Deliver the barrels to Merilien","The wedding planner in Minas Tirith seeks barrels of the city's finest ales for her events.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Collected barrels of ale (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hmmm? Oh yes, a cask of my finest! This is no Beren's Blood, I'll have you know! Merilien has much better taste of course. The barrel is just up there, with our other supplies.'","What Ales You","'Have you collected my supplies?'","Merilien is located on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith. \
\
You should being the casks of ale to Merilien.","'You must be here for Merilien's order. Wouldn't do to be late for her now would it?'\
\
The barkeep gives you a knowing wink.\
\
'The cask you have come for is in the northern storeroom. Don't fall into the well, now, you hear?'","Collect barrels of ale (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Wedding guests are a thirsty lot, and we shall serve nothing less than the city’s finest ales at our events. I have put in orders with the best taverns in the city for barrels of their choicest ales. Go and fetch them, if you would. It would save me a great deal of time.'"},
[14540]={"A Culhuc le gustaría que recolectaras donde anidan los avanc en el Aguaestancada.","Los huevos de avanc pueden encontrarse en el Aguaestancada\
\
Recoge huevos de avanc","Recoge huevos de avanc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, los huevos que pedí. ¿Los lavaste en el agua antes de traerlos aquí, verdad?'\
\
Antes de que puedas responder, toma uno de los huevos y ves cómo su sonrisa se transforma en un profundo ceño fruncido.\
\
'No importa. Solo... lavaré este huevo, y mis manos, y por favor déjalos en el suelo y dame un momento.\
\
'Gracias, supongo'","Culhuc está atendiendo el horno comunitario en Lhan Garan\
\
Habla con Culhuc.","'Dirígete al oeste, hacia Aguaestancada, para encontrar a los avanc y sus nidos.'","Entrega huevos de avanc a Culhuc","Huevos de avanc recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me encantaría conseguir algunos huevos de avanc, pero soy mejor luchando contra personas que contra bestias. Es cosa de la cadera, agacharme me cuesta. Hay una gran población de avanc en Aguaestancada.\
\
'¿Hmm? ¿Cuántos? Bueno, son huevos grandes, así que seis.'","Qué comen los Avanc"},
[14541]={"El rastro de la criatura parece terminar aquí... quizá cruzó hacia la orilla oriental","Encontraste el cadáver del ciervo blanco y recuperaste las flechas de Wistan, pero algo ya ha devorado gran parte del cuerpo.","Sigue el rastro de la criatura hacia el este, a lo largo de la ribera","as huellas de la criatura continúan hacia el este a lo largo de la ribera.\
\
Deberías seguir las huellas de la criatura.","La criatura que devoró al ciervo blanco puede haber dejado huellas cerca, que deberías <rgb=#FF00FF>mirar</rgb> para encontrarlas.\
\
Pudiste recuperar las flechas de Wistan, pero algo ha devorado ya gran parte del cadáver del ciervo blanco. Las marcas en el cadáver no parecen ser de un animal ni de un troll silvano. Algo más está rondando Tâl Bruinen, y deberías descubrir qué es.","El rastro de la criatura gira hacia el este a lo largo de la ribera","Sigue el rastro de la criatura hacia el noreste, en dirección al río","Pudiste recuperar las flechas de Wistan, pero algo ha devorado ya gran parte del cadáver del ciervo blanco. Las marcas en el cadáver no parecen ser de un animal ni de un troll silvano. Algo más está rondando Tâl Bruinen, y deberías descubrir qué es.","Deberías <rgb=#FF00FF>mirar</rgb> y encontrar las huellas de la criatura","Alguna criatura ronda Tâl Bruinen, y deberías descubrir qué es","Las huellas de la criatura continúan hacia el noreste en dirección al río.\
\
Deberías seguir las huellas de la criatura.","Encuentra el rastro de la criatura","¿Qué Bestia?","Has encontrado las huellas de la criatura, y parecen conducir hacia el noreste, de regreso al río","La criatura que devoró al ciervo blanco puede haber dejado huellas cerca, que deberías <rgb=#FF00FF>mirar</rgb> para encontrarlas.\
\
Pudiste recuperar las flechas de Wistan, pero algo ha devorado ya gran parte del cadáver del ciervo blanco. Las marcas en el cadáver no parecen ser de un animal ni de un troll silvano. Algo más está rondando Tâl Bruinen, y deberías descubrir qué es","Las huellas continúan hacia el noreste en dirección al río","Las huellas de la criatura conducen hacia el noreste desde el cadáver del ciervo blanco, en dirección al río.\
\
Deberías seguir las huellas de la criatura."},
[14542]={"'Have you found anything of interest?'","Records might be found in the town of Audaghaim, east of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
You should comb through the ruins of Audaghaim and try to uncover any records that may have been kept around the time of the Necromancer's influence.","Habla con Prestadír en la Posada Embrujada","'The Dark Lord has a remarkable talent for corrupting nearly all that is good, but even he cannot doom mortal Men to remain cursed after death by association alone. Such a curse would only take hold for the deepest of betrayals, when the hearts of Men are willingly inclined to evil...only by the greatest of Powers can the spirits of Men be held to this world.\
\
'These tokens of fealty are surely only the beginning of the story. The Necromancer persuaded his woods-dwelling neighbours to swear allegiance to him, but what after that? I have my suspicions. One hears oft of such tales.\
\
'You should search the rubble of the town and see if any history can be found. Perhaps there are records kept by these Woodmen in the months preceding or following the intrusion of Dol Guldur.'","Prestadír is at the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, west of Audaghaim.\
\
You should show Prestadír the book you unearthed in Audaghaim.","What Came to Pass","'Ah! This is just what I was hoping for. I am not surprised that someone took the time to bury it. Many pages are missing, as you can see, as is the case with many aged books, but these were deliberately ripped out.\
\
'Is it not a fine coincidence that the pages that were removed are from TA 2461, and the same week that marks the \\qaccidental\\q deaths of many folks who rest in the graveyard yonder?\
\
'I would dearly like to find those missing pages, or at least hear the account that is missing from this book.'","'Surely these Woodmen kept some written history of their town and its events. I wonder if we will find a record of what transpired to doom them to remain after death. You should search the ruins of Audaghaim, ${PLAYER}.'","Search Audaghaim for town records","Uncovered a battered book with several leaves missing, buried in the foundation of an old building","Prestadír hopes to learn more of the history of Audaghaim and determine why the former inhabitants of this town are doomed to remain."},
[14543]={"The barren patches of land in the Black Heart still bear the shades of terrible events in the past, long remembering the suffering of the trees.\
\
Where is the Ent you saw that once watched over these lands? If his realm has grown so dark, what has become of him?","Barren patches of land can be found throughout the Black Heart in Fangorn, especially in the deeper reaches of the wood.\
\
You should examine the barren patches to see why nothing will grow there.","Examine barren patches for answers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The land itself remembers the cruelties done to the trees, and will not grow (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","The barren patches of land in the Black Heart still bear the shades of terrible events in the past, long remembering the suffering of the trees.","What Could Do This?","Find barren patches of land in the Black Heart","Many blackened swaths of land are barren even of the twisted plants that grow in the darkest part of the forest. What happened here to turn the Black Heart so rotten?"},
[14544]={"¿Qué más quedó atrás?","Has recuperado el objeto tomado del campamento de la Compañía, que resultó ser nada más que una olla de cocina, pero Golgallon teme que puedan haber quedado otros signos más reveladores.","'De hecho, tuvimos suerte de que todo lo que la Compañía dejó atrás fue una olla de cocina, pero temo por la negligencia de los hobbits. No estoy seguro de que aún comprendan completamente que su misión no es un simple paseo por el campo.\
\
'No obstante, es nuestro deber asegurarnos de que el Enemigo no aprenda más sobre la Compañía o su misión. Para ello, quiero que vayas a Echad Dúnann, a cierta distancia al sureste de aquí, y hables con Rinneldor.\
\
'Dile todo lo que ha sucedido y sírvele lo mejor que puedas.'","'Apresúrate a Echad Dúnann y habla con Rinneldor. El campamento se encuentra al sureste.'","Habla con Rinneldor en Echad Dúnann","'Te doy la bienvenida a Echad Dúnann, ${PLAYER}. Aprecio tus noticias, aunque también me preocupan.\
\
'Quédate un rato... tenemos mucho que discutir.'","Rinneldor está en Echad Dúnann, a cierta distancia al sureste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Golgallon te ha pedido que hables con Rinneldor sobre los movimientos de la Compañía y los descubrimientos que has hecho."},
[14547]={"Reek-weeds grow along the river-banks of the Anduin to the north of Thinglad.\
\
You should crush reek-weed leaves along the river-banks to help dissuade the fishermen from setting up camp there.","'If you are looking to discourage our southern neighbours from wandering so far north, ${PLAYER}, I have an idea for you.\
\
'There is a weed that grows along the river-banks of the Anduin, and its leaves smell quite terrible when crushed. We Elves do not disturb these plants. If you find any, however, it might benefit our cause to befoul the air with their odour. Do you not agree?'","What Is That Smell?","Noriel has an idea for making the woods near the river less attractive for the Rohirrim trespassers from Stangard.","'I think you will recognize the plant if you try breaking a leaf. The effects should be immediate! I only hope they do not dissuade you from remaining in Thinglad as well.'","Find Noriel at Haldirith","Crush reek-weeds to unleash foul odours (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Noriel can be found in the watch-post Haldirith in northern Thinglad.\
\
You should return to Noriel and tell her that many horrid smells have been unleashed upon the forest.","'You need not tell me that your mission was a success, ${PLAYER}. I could tell the deed was done before you even came through the brush.\
\
'Fear not! The odour will fade soon. This is a clean place, and the airs here will soon wash you of that putrid scent.'","Crushed reek-weeds to unleash foul odours (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14548]={"The sounds of Orcs echo from out of the cavernous maggot-holes","Candúr can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should talk to Candúr before you depart.","'If what you relate is true, why then an entire army hides in wait below the ground! We know full well that overwhelming odds stand locked behind the Morannon. But we shall not face those until the ordained time of battle, according to Lord Aragorn's plan. \
\
'What if this nether army poured forth to accost us before that time? What last gleam of hope might be lost if my Lord's plan faltered? No, it is clear. We must do something if we may... whatever we may.'","Find the entrance to Carchost","What Lies Beneath the Hills","You should return to Thurindol, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.","'You are going beneath Carchost, then? I am glad you are willing to help us in this. It will be dangerous, but for this task I have faith in none so much as you. Fortune smile on you. We will speak again, I am sure of it.'","'${PLAYER}, you honour the name Ranger with your bravery and commitment to Gondor. We shall see you again soon. This deed you undertake will not go unremembered by my order. I will see to it.'","Thurindol believes that there are even more enemies beneath the Slag-hills and asks of you to investigate.","Find the entrance to Skoironk","Talk to Thurindol","Talk to Candúr","Enter Skoironk","Carchost and Skoironk are located in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should find the entrances and enter Carchost and Skoironk.","Thurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","'I tell you, ${PLAYER}, I have wondered whether I were going mad. I would track an Orc Captain climbing the nearby eastern hills, only to lose track of him. Then, as if by some sorcery, I would espy him far west, where I should surely have seen him pass.\
\
'The riddle has evaded me until now. The maggot-holes must communicate in tunnels deep beneath these midden-heaps, and access fundaments beneath the Towers of the Teeth, as well.  It is the only answer!\
\
'Will you investigate? Find a way into Carchost and discover what pathways lie below.\
\
'Ah, but I forget myself. You should speak with Candúr before you go.'","Enter Carchost","Many dangers may lie ahead within the tower of Carchost"},
[14549]={"Tras completar una misión, has encontrado un zircón con una llamativa oscuridad dentro de la gema. Después de examinarlo con cuidado, has decidido buscar a alguien que pueda ser capaz de determinar por qué la oscuridad parece agitarse y moverse dentro de la gema. Quizá una de las personas que encomiendan las misiones sepan de qué se trata.","Lo que se esconde en el interior...","Examinas con cuidado la piedra y determinas que la oscuridad de su interior se mueve. No hay duda alguna. Se agita con la malevolencia de una violenta tormenta. Aunque parece peligroso, también hay algo en ella que resulta a la vez tentador y embriagador.\
\
Sacudes la cabeza para aclarar tus pensamientos antes de caer en un trance profundo provocado por la oscuridad que se agita en la piedra.\
\
Debe haber alguien que sepa qué es esto. Quizá quienes encomiendan las misiones en Cardolan y la Ciénaga de los Cisnes sepan algo.","'Me alegra que hayas vuelto, ${PLAYER}. Esta pequeña gema tiene oscuridad dentro. ¿Puedes verla arremolinándose justo bajo la superficie? Me da escalofríos cada vez que pienso qué poder ha podido imbuir oscuridad a esta pequeña gema. Me ha hecho pensar en ti y otros como tú, siempre dispuestos a asumir riesgos por el bien de la mayoría.\
\
'Creo que hay una posibilidad de que puedan sacar a la luz criaturas realmente maliciosas que acechan en las sombras. He estado trabajando con algunos otros compañeros y nos hemos puesto de acuerdo para proveer de recompensas a aventureros de valía como tú. Si puedes encontrar más de estas gemas y liberar la oscuridad que hay en ellas, quizá todos salgamos ganando. Las gemas son muy bellas, si obviamos este terrible defecto y valdrán bastante dinero cuando estén purificadas.\
\
'Lleva una a alguna misión para ver si puedes limpiar la oscuridad de su interior.'","Lleva el inquietante zircón a una persona encargada de encomendar misiones en Cardolan o la Ciénaga de los Cisnes","Después de examinar la piedra y casi caer bajo el influjo de los miasmas del interior de la gema, decides llevarla a uno de las personas que encomiendan las misiones. Quizá sea algo que hayan visto antes y puedan ayudarte a identificar la causa o el propósito de la oscura gema."},
[14551]={"Ordâkhai have reinforced the pit-mine in an attempt to quash the prison revolt.","What They Deserve","'The prison revolt we started has spread to the pit-mine. Our people fight for their lives! Get in there and give those Ordâkhai what they deserve.'","Defeated Ordâkhai in Esh Mêkag pit-mine (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Ebuzâm","You have done much to aid the thralls revolting in Esh Mêkag.\
\
You should return to Ebuzâm.","'Good work, ${PLAYER}. They deserve worse, but we have a battle to win.'","Esh Mêkag is in a state of revolt.\
\
You should defeat Ordâkhai in the Esh Mêkag pit-mine.","Defeat Ordâkhai in Esh Mêkag pit-mine (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14552]={"'Our quest for more knowledge of the stone and of Núrzum must wait.\
\
'You must go to Byre Tor in Cyneberg's stead, for I worry for the people there. Their city is a bit wild, and the folk there are not friendly to strangers. They are savage even compared to us here.\
\
'Be careful out there, ${PLAYER}. The High Knolls are dangerous even in the best of times, and I could not bear to lose you too!'","Small gusts of frosty air have appeared in Byre Tor.\
\
You should examine the little bursts of cold.","Enter the village of Byre Tor","You should complete a thorough search of Byre Tor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: To do this, you must accept the remotely bestowed quest.</rgb>","Complete your search of Byre Tor's homes","The Byre Tor banners have been defiled by Orcs! This does not bode well for the city....","Examine a frosty gust of air","You glimpse a Rohirric banner on the road ahead; the city of Byre Tor is near","Gárwig wants you to put aside your search for Saruman's vile stone, and look instead to the people of Byre Tor.","The banners of Byre Tor can be found along the road leading north into the High Knolls from the Whitshaws.\
\
You should approach the banners.","Byre Tor lies up the road in the southern High Knolls.\
\
You should go to Byre Tor and see what damage the enemy has done there.","Destroy defiled Byre Tor banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Byre Tor can be reached by following the road from Forlaw all the way north through the Whitshaws, up into the craggy High Knolls.\
\
You should ride north to Byre Tor by way of the road.","Take the north road through the Whitshaws towards Byre Tor","Continue up the road","Destroyed a defiled Byre Tor banner (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defiled banners lie along the road to Byre Tor in the south-western High Knolls.\
\
You should destroy the defiled banners set by the Orcs.","Frosty gusts of air have appeared in Byre Tor. Perhaps it is nothing to worry about, but it is good to notice these things.","What Waits at Byre Tor"},
[14553]={"Approach Kakhât","Halnith has sighted smoke rising from a lit camp-fire in Makham Mijann. You should investigate.\
\
Makham Mijann is located to the north of Nendath.","Talk to Halnith","Investigate the lit camp-fire at Makham Mijann","You have found a dying Corsair hiding in a tent at Makham Mijann.\
\
You should talk to him.","Return to Halnith at Nendath","Kakhât softly barks at you","'Nothing you can do will hurt me, stranger. I'll be gone soon. Curse the warmongers that took me so far from home. May the seas take them all! May they --'\
\
Whatever the Corsair intends to say next devolves into a series of dry, rattling coughs.\
\
'Still listening to this dying man's last words? Then...' With a trembling hand, he reaches out to pet his war-hound. 'Take this whistle, and Kakhât will follow. He was never made for war. He doesn't deserve the same sad end that I do.\
\
'Leave me, Kakhât. Go.'","Kakhât sniffs your hand. Before the hound leaves his master's side, he looks to him -- for further commands, perhaps. But the Corsair utters no more words.","Use the whistle to summon Kakhât to your side","Kakhât abruptly trots over to Halnith's side and lies down. Something tells you that even if you used the whistle to call him, he would simply refuse to listen.","Check on Kakhât","Makham Mijann may not be fully abandoned.","'For the last few days, smoke has been rising from Makham Mijann, perhaps from a single camp-fire. I can't imagine anyone would be eager to hide out in an abandoned Corsair war-camp, unless they held some sort of ill intent.\
\
'Obviously, I cannot leave my post, but I see that you're quite familiar with adventuring. Will you investigate in my stead?'","'Had I known what was happening at that camp-fire... but I did not, and he was beyond help. To die nameless and forsaken in an unfamiliar place... I only hope your actions gave him some semblance of peace.'\
\
Halnith reaches down to gently pet the hound, who only responds with a tired thump of his tail.\
\
'I daresay he's found his new home.' A smile breaks across Halnith's face. 'Guarding the beacon doesn't sound like such a lonely task anymore.'","There is nothing you can do for the dying Corsair, but he has asked you to take his war-hound Kakhât with you.\
\
You should approach Kakhât.","Upon arriving at Nendath, Kakhât barked at you.\
\
You should check on him.","The Corsair narrows his eyes at you","What Was Left Behind","You should return to Halnith at Nendath with your new companion.\
\
Nendath stands to the south of Makham Mijann.","You should tell Halnith what you found at Makham Mijann.\
\
She stands guard at Nendath.","Talk to the dying Corsair"},
[14554]={"Talk to Kurtil","'They will all soon be here. Will it go well? We have done so much, have we not? Ah, but who can say! Still, we must wait, yes? Wait and try.\
\
'Soon they will be here. Wait with me, ${CLASS}. Not long now. Not long.'","You should return to Barathron in the Foothold in Udûn and tell him all about the disastrous meeting and the hopes that died there.","'You return! You have been gone long. What do you know of the flags? What secret plans do the lurkers plan for us?'\
\
You begin to tell him all that happened and his face goes slack.\
\
'Captain of the Pit! And you know not what became of that Nurnhoth, Kurtil? He simply slipped off. It is all so peculiar. Nor did I ever imagine, friend, that I should feel sympathy for the bangers and the clangers here that armed the Enemy's armies against us. All suffered under the Dark Lord's reign, that much is clear! \
\
'Now, at least, we know the name of our true adversary in this place. Perhaps with time we may earn the trust of those who fled and lived and with their help work against him.'","'Stand here. Wait with me. I will tell you more of the signs shared among our kind.'\
\
Kurtil tells you more.  Time passes.","Return to Barathron","You should talk to Kurtil, who has arrived at the meeting place in Maudhúl Ghûg.","What Was Spoken and What Revealed","The meeting between the discontent forge-workers and the Easterlings has been arranged, the meeting place prepared, and the flag raised. Now for the meeting to begin."},
[14555]={"Anyâmat thinks it would be a great idea to fight a giant crab named Shelly.\
\
Shelly may be found on Baj Khatûg, an island off the eastern shore of Zamarzîr.","Shelly has fallen! Talk to Anyâmat about what to do next.\
\
Anyâmat may be summoned by using Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory. Anyâmat may only be summoned while in and around Zamarzîr.","'I once overheard a sailor tell a story wherein she faced down a ferocious beast. Let us seek out the most horrifying creature these isles have to offer! There is a giant crab on a small island east of here. I hear folks have nicknamed it Shelly. Let's go fight it!'","'What a fearsome beast! Its hands were like spiked gauntlets! You were lucky I was around to help or you'd have been in a lot of trouble.'","Defeat Shelly","What if We Fight a Giant Crab?","Anyâmat harbours aspirations of being a great shanty-man.","Talk to Anyâmat","Defeated Shelly"},
[14556]={"The farmer's son should also be somewhere in the herd-lands in Trum Dreng.\
\
There is only one Stag-clansman left to find, and he is not with the others: the herdsman's son Dilwun.","The farmer's family should be somewhere in the herd-lands.\
\
Whether dead or alive, you should find Trev's family before reporting back to Lhan Tarren.","Search for the farmer's son Dilwun","This man probably worked for the farmer, but he lies face-down in the water. It is obvious that he has not drawn breath for too long now....","You have discovered the last member of Trev's family, and he too is dead... murdered and left at the river-bank to be carried away when the rains come.\
\
The Elder will be sorely grieved by this news. The Stag-clan has now grown smaller and more vulnerable.","The farmhand Celun has been murdered and left at the bank of the river","Trev has been brutally slain during the Dragon-clan invasion","What of the Farmer?","'I hope you do not meet an untimely end with your good intentions, ${PLAYER}. It would be a tragedy for a good soul like yourself to die needlessly while seeking the dead.'","'I might have heard someone from the herdsman's family the night the Dragon-clan came. I heard a terrible scream, but there was naught that we could do without weapons.\
\
'There was no light at all. No light... only screams. The screaming went on, then was silent. Whatever happened to that poor family, it was nothing good.\
\
'It is good of you to want to look for them, but are you certain it is worth the risk? It is folly to seek the dead while their killers lurk nearby.'","Search for the Celun, the farmhand","Search for Trev, the chief herdsman","This is undoubtedly Trev, the chief herdsman in these lands.\
\
Trev appears to have been murdered during the invasion. His face and body are contorted as if he died in considerable pain; perhaps his were the screams heard on the night of the raid.","You helped some travellers who witnessed the sacking of the herd-lands, but it is now time to seek the farmer and his family. They have not been seen since the Dragon-clan came."},
[14557]={"'Do you mean to hurt us, Duvodiad? You and many others, I am sure. Well, get it over with.\
\
'We are outcasts, and there is nothing left for us. We do not even have the means to escape into Enedwaith now. The Draig-lûth will see us. We have no food. At least you can grant us merciful death.'","Since the craban from the farm on the herd-lands returned injured and without the presence of its recipient, the people of Lhan Tarren have been worried about the herdsman Trev and his family.","'Are you certain that you want me to remain here? I am accustomed to danger, ${PLAYER}. But... I suppose the Elder wants me near in times such as these.\
\
'I wish more than anything that my people were more like you so that I could fulfill my duties....'","'This is dreadful, ${PLAYER}... you saw the crow with your own eyes. I know something terrible has happened where Trev and his folk live in the herd-lands.\
\
'Trev, his farmhand Celun, and his son Dilwun have been helping to feed our folk from the wealth of the herd-lands for a long time.\
\
'We must investigate. I worry that Elain's safety must be compromised again, or Guto's. I do not like throwing my only warrior into danger, or my only grandson. Alas! What am I to do?'","The Elder is grateful that Elain, just returned, may be spared the danger this once","Tell the Elder that you volunteer yourself to investigate his missing clansmen","There seem to be hostile Dunlendings on the road. Try following the river","The herd-lands can be found by following the road south from Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should travel down the road in search of what may have intercepted the crow.","Elder Riagán is in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should tell the troubled Elder that you volunteer your own strength and skill for the task of finding out what might be wrong in the south.","What of the Herd-lands?","Take the road south towards the herd-lands","You hear muffled voices, coming from the west bank","'You offer to go in Elain's stead, ${PLAYER}? Is there no end to your bravery and generosity? You, a duvodiad to us, would put yourself in danger to find a missing man you have never met?\
\
'It does not seem possible. I do not know how we can ever repay you, good ${PLAYER}!'","'I am so worried, ${PLAYER}. I do not know how to protect my people with what little strength we have left.'"},
[14558]={"La ciudad de Herne es más segura ahora que el Miedo Gris ha sido derrotado. Pero, ¿comprenderá el alcalde Nevit el papel que jugó su hija en la caída de un mal que ha asolado el país durante cientos de años?","'¿Tú otra vez, eh? ¿Qué travesura han estado tramando tú y mi hija?'\
\
Le cuentas acerca de Sarch Vorn, Luilloth y el Miedo Gris. Luego le hablas del esqueleto erosionado. Permanece en silencio durante mucho tiempo.\
\
'¿Su collar? Entonces... ¿no nos abandonó después de todo? ¿Fue un accidente?'\
\
Suspira profundamente.\
\
'Rhiangar y tú hicieron todo eso, y además ayudaste a cocinar mi estofado favorito. Yo... Me temo que he sido injusto contigo, ${CLASS}. Durante tantos años, la ira ha sido lo único que he conocido. Pero hoy, hoy me has traído esperanza.\
\
'Rhiangar y tú han demostrado que la historia es importante, pero que recrearse en el pasado no es lo que se necesita. Usar lo que aprendemos de nuestra historia aquí, en el presente, eso es lo importante.\
\
'Eso, y la gente que tenemos. Luilloth perdió su vida para vengar a su familia y mantener Cardolan a salvo, al igual que mi esposa. Mi hija y tú siguieron sus pasos, y aun así superaron lo que ellas pudieron lograr. Rhiangar nunca estuvo persiguiendo un sueño tonto, ni tampoco su madre. Ambas sabían que había peligro, y tomaron medidas para enfrentarlo. Estoy... arrepentido, y agradecido. Siempre serás bienvenido aquí, en Herne, y en nuestro hogar. Te lo agradezco.'","Habla con el alcalde Nevit","'Lo que encontraste en Sarch Vorn no me trajo alegría, pero sí me brindó algo de paz. Por favor, cuéntale también a mi padre lo que encontraste allí. Merece saber que ella no nos abandonó a propósito.\
\
'Padre está sentado junto a la puerta. Aparentemente se sirvió del estofado mientras estábamos fuera, ya que no queda nada.'\
\
Ella se ríe suavemente, sacudiendo la cabeza.","Rhiangar te ha pedido que le digas al alcalde Nevit que encontraste el cuerpo de su esposa en las afueras de Sarch Vorn.\
\
El alcalde Nevit está dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada, en Herne.","Lo que forjó el collar"},
[14559]={"Toronn desea abandonar la Tierra Media, pero su hermano Bregar cree que deberían quedarse.","'Esta hoja significa mucho, aunque esté rota y desafilada. Lamentablemente, el paso del tiempo hace poco para borrar mis recuerdos de aquella batalla.\
\
'Quizás he subestimado la importancia de los lazos fraternales.'","Lleva la espada rota a Bregar","'¿Has encontrado la hoja, ${PLAYER}?'","Lo que se ha perdido","'¡Busca la espada rota en Dol Ringwest, al oeste de aquí! ¡Es muy importante!'","Has encontrado la espada rota","Bregar te espera en Duillond, al este de las ruinas de Dol Ringwest.\
\
Has recuperado una espada rota de un túmulo funerario en las ruinas élficas de Dol Ringwest.","La espada rota se encuentra sobre un túmulo de piedras en las ruinas de Dol Ringwest, al oeste de Duillond.\
\
Bregar te ha pedido que busques en las ruinas de Dol Ringwest el túmulo de piedras y la espada rota que contiene, y que se la lleves a él.","'Toronn debe saber que, aunque me quede atrás, siempre estaré a su lado. Para ello, necesitaré tu ayuda. Esta tierra ha sido nuestro refugio y nuestra maestra, y nuestros recuerdos están llenos de momentos de alegría y risas gracias a ella.\
\
'Creo que, quizás, mi hermano apreciará esto lo suficiente como para entender que yo emprendo mi viaje al mismo tiempo que él comienza el suyo. En las ruinas de Dol Ringwest, hay una espada sobre un túmulo de piedras, que una vez portó un Dúnadan con el que luchamos juntos en defensa de nuestra tierra natal. Quizás pueda recordarle a mi hermano nuestro deber hacia la Tierra Media.\
\
'Mis obligaciones aquí no me permiten irme, pero espero que entiendas la necesidad que tengo de cerrar esta brecha entre mi hermano y yo. ¿Me ayudarás?'","Busca en el túmulo de piedras la espada rota"},
[14560]={"Volver a Tam Tejobaya","'Etta está paseando de un lado a otro. Nunca es buena señal cuando Etta está paseando de un lado a otro. ¡Por favor, trae de vuelta las bayas tan rápido como puedas!'","Tam Tejobaya te ha pedido que recojas bayas rojas de los arbustos en las ruinas cerca del Campamento de Siempreviva.","Bayas rojas de arbusto recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¿Qué está comiendo Etta?","Recoge bayas rojas de arbusto (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El esposo de Etta Tejobaya está haciendo todo lo posible para mantener a su esposa, pero un ataque reciente de los orcos de Tharbad los ha dejado sin ninguno de los suministros que trajeron con ellos desde Bree.","Deberías llevar las bayas a Tam Tejobaya.\
\
Tam está en el Campamento de Siempreviva, en el sur de Cardolan.","'¿Las tienes? ¡Sí! Oh, esto es maravilloso. Sé que solo satisfará este antojo temporal, pero no puedo esperar a ver la sonrisa que estas traerán al rostro de Etta.'","'Hola. Estos son días desdichados. ¡Mira nuestros estantes! Vacíos después de la redada de los orcos de Tharbad, ¡y tengo una esposa embarazada a la que alimentar! Etta está antojada de bayas y... bueno, aprendí con los dos primeros hijos a no discutir con una futura madre antojada.\
\
'Lamentablemente, no soy un guerrero y no puedo dejar el campamento. ¿Pero quizás puedas ayudarnos? Al norte hay unas ruinas, entre las cuales crecen arbustos cubiertos con las bayas favoritas de Etta. Si nos traes algunas de vuelta, quizás podamos detener su ir y venir.'"},
[14561]={"Guano piles can be found in the Lair of the Gloom-lord.\
\
You should collect guano piles because Viznak asked.","'So this is guano? Smells good! Want to taste?'\
\
You vigorously shake your head no. Viznak shrugs and then gives it a try.\
\
'So tasty! Maybe I should get my own bats!'","Collected guano piles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Viznak has asked you to collect some guano for him from the Gloom-lord's lair. You shudder to think why he wants it.","Collect guano piles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","What's Guano?","Viznak can be found outside of Seregost once you have completed Surveying Seregost.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Talk to Viznak after completing Surveying Seregost","'In bat cave, I sometimes see white stuff on the ground. Know what I mean?'\
\
You tell him you do, and that it is called 'guano.'\
\
'Guano? What's that? Will you get some for me?'"},
[14562]={"'Ahora que te has ocupado de los linces, necesitaremos reducir un poco la población de lobos para asegurar que el equilibrio se mantenga.\
\
'Dirígete al noreste y da caza a algunos Lobos gélidos. Sin duda esas criaturas malignas son espías de los trasgos.'","'Dirígete al noreste y da caza a algunos Lobos gélidos. Sin duda esas criaturas malignas son espías de los trasgos.'","Los lobos pueden encontrarse junto al lago congelado, al noreste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Nos Grimsong te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de lobos en la región.","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Gracias a tus esfuerzos, nuestro hogar estará mejor en el futuro.\
\
'Por favor, toma esto junto con mi agradecimiento como recompensa.'","Lobos gélidos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ahora que has reducido la población de linces, Nos te ha pedido que te ocupes de los lobos al noreste.","Cuando el Depredador se Vuelve Presa","Derrota Lobos gélidos Canosos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota Lobos gélidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lobos gélidos canosos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nos Grimsong está en la esquina noroeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Debes regresar con Nos Grimsong por tu recompensa.","Habla con Nos Grimsong en el Patio de Frerin"},
[14563]={"'¿Eres ${PLAYER}, ${PLAYER:el héroe local[m]|la heroína local[f]} de quien tanto he oído hablar? ¡Me alegro muchísimo de que hayas llegado a tiempo para la temporada de floración! Verás, necesito ayuda urgentemente...'","'Deberías hablar con Avery. Seguro que puedes encontrarlo en la Plaza del Mercado de Bree.'","'¡Vaya, qué casualidad! Pareces ser la persona indicada. Avery Manzanagria, un amigo mío de Bree, buscaba a alguien de tu renombre para que lo ayudara. Hasta la persona más inquebrantable puede dejarse llevar en primavera, especialmente con todas esas preciosas flores floreciendo. ¡El aroma de las flores y el romance flota en el aire! Ve a hablar con Avery si tienes tiempo. Lo encontrarás en la Plaza del Mercado de Bree.'","'Avery está en Bree, en algún lugar de la Plaza del Mercado. ¡Espero de veras que puedas ayudarlo!'","'¡Ah, la primavera! El aroma de las flores flota en el aire. Vaya, en ninguna otra semana del año son tan abundantes, y están floreciendo por todo Ered Luin, la Comarca y Bree. Avery Manzanagria, en la ciudad de Bree, buscaba a alguien que lo sacara de un apuro, ¡y creo que das el perfil! Ve a hablar con él si tienes tiempo. Lo encontrarás en la Plaza del Mercado de Bree.'","Durante un breve periodo cada año, florecen raras flores por toda la Tierra Media. Avery Manzanagria necesita tu ayuda durante este evento especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","'¡Vaya, qué suerte! He oído decir que Avery Manzanagria, un hombre de Bree, necesita ayuda. Es la semana anual de las flores, cuando las flores locales más bellas florecen en Ered Luin, la Comarca y Bree. Avery buscaba a alguien de renombre que lo ayudara. ¡Creo que eres justo la persona indicada! Ve a hablar con él si tienes tiempo. Lo encontrarás en la Plaza del Mercado de Bree.'","Avery Manzanagria está en la Plaza del Mercado de Bree.\
\
Deberías hablar con Avery Manzanagria, ya que se te ha pedido que lo ayudes con una tarea muy difícil durante la temporada de floración.","'¡Espero que puedas ayudar a Avery a salir de su apuro! Debería estar en la Plaza del Mercado de Bree.'","Habla con Avery Manzanagria durante la temporada de floración","Cuando florecen las flores raras"},
[14564]={"Idmar is unsettled by the arrival of fallen warriors of Gondor at the Field of Celebrant.","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should return to Idmar with news of your success.","'It is certain that these Oathbreakers are a danger to the people of Stangard, and we must make clear the road for our scouting missions into the Rushgore.\
\
'These spirits are lost and confused... the best we can offer them is a swift return to rest.\
\
'They have appeared all across the Field, so you can find them both to the east and west of here. I cannot afford word of this situation reaching Stangard... or worse, Edoras. Go!'","Talk to Idmar","'Banish the Oathbreakers, ${PLAYER}... they present too great a threat to Stangard.'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'While I am not certain that the spirits will remain at rest, I know that any respite from their fate must bring them joy.'","The Oathbreakers of Parth Celebrant can be found to the north, east, and west of Idmar's camp.\
\
Idmar has asked you to banish the shades from Parth Celebrant.","Defeated Oathbreaker champions (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Oathbreaker archers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Oathbreaker archers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Whence They Came","Defeat Oathbreaker champions (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14565]={"¿De dónde vienen los Muertos?","Ivorel desea conocer el origen de los Muertos que acechan en las regiones orientales de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","'El Destino de los Hombres resulta realmente desconcertante para nosotros, los Primeros Nacidos. ¿Morir y abandonar el propio mundo? ¿Para ir adónde? Se dice que ni siquiera los Señores del Occidente Más Allá conocen la respuesta completa.\
\
Pero, sea cual sea su destino, es una deshonra permitir que criaturas como los hombres demacrados utilicen sus cuerpos vacíos.'","El campamento de Ivorel se encuentra al suroeste de los túmulos.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Ivorel con las piedras grabadas que has encontrado.","'Una advertencia, ${PLAYER}... si te adentras en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas hacia el este, pronto te encontrarás entre varios túmulos de los que los Muertos han emergido para servir a nuestro Enemigo. No en vano se ocultó bajo el nombre del Nigromante.\
\
Sin embargo, estos no son túmulos antiguos. No había ninguno en esta zona en la época en que mi pueblo vivía en Emyn Lûm.\
\
Así pues, no sé quién —o qué— se alza ahora contra nosotros. Busca las piedras de los túmulos si puedes y observa sus inscripciones. Tal vez podamos averiguar más sobre la naturaleza de este lugar y cómo someterlo.'","Examina piedras grabadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ya veo. Las runas que has descubierto narran una historia verdaderamente dolorosa. Uno de los Hombres traídos por Sauron desde el Este fue literalmente explotado hasta la muerte en la construcción de su fortaleza aquí, en Amon Lanc, hace muchos años.\
\
Incluso tras la muerte, estos Hombres siguen siendo obligados a servir, pues sus túmulos actúan como una línea de defensa en caso de que Dol Guldur sea atacado. O al menos sus cuerpos, ya que el Señor Oscuro no puede encadenar sus espíritus.'","Los túmulos se encuentran en las regiones orientales de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas, al noreste del campamento de Ivorel.\
\
Ivorel te ha pedido que estudies las piedras de los túmulos en busca de inscripciones que puedan describir su historia y dar alguna pista sobre la naturaleza de la amenaza que albergan.","Piedras grabadas examinadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14566]={"Where Fear Has Gone","Defeated Ruthless Oathbreakers in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Dead can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You have encountered the Ruthless Dead and should defeat them before they can be wielded against the people of Gondor.","Defeat Ruthless Bowmen in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Ruthless Oathbreakers in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Drawn to Tarlang's Crown by Azruthor, the Ruthless Dead now strike fear into the enemies of the Heirs of Castamir.","Defeated Ruthless Warriors in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated many Dead in Tarlang's Crown.","While searching for leader of the Dead that Gondren mentioned, you have encountered many other grim Oathbreakers in Tarlang's Crown. The fear these cursed Men could strike into the people of Gondor is unknowable, and would break many Gondorian forces before the Corsairs even drew their blades.\
\
If victory is to be won against Azruthor and his forces in Tarlang's Crown, they must be put to rest, even if only for a short while.","Defeat Ruthless Warriors in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","DNT -- will not be seen","Completado","You have defeated many of the Dead in Tarlang's Crown. Although their curse shall bring them forth once more, you have greatly weakened the forces in Tarlang's Crown, albeit temporarily.","Defeated Ruthless Bowmen in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14567]={"Quickbeam can be found in Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn has found no sign of Treebeard. As its agitation has not subsided by now, you should bring him to Quickbeam and have him explain where Treebeard has gone.","'Hoom broom broom. Back so soon, little one?'\
\
You explain the Huorn's concern about Treebeard to Quickbeam.\
\
'Hum, I understand his worries.... Let me speak to him and see if I cannot calm his passion.'\
\
Quickbeam begins to speak to the Huorn in slow, deep tones you cannot understand. After several minutes, the Huorn's tenseness seems to fade.\
\
'Hoom... by his sleeping, he missed many important happenings in the forest. It is understood now, ${PLAYER}.'","Since you cannot, perhaps Quickbeam can tell the Huorn where Treebeard has gone","According to Quickbeam's Huorn, Treebeard must be somewhere in Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn wants to search for Treebeard as he could be of great help in maintaining order in the forest. You should aid the Huorn.","Talk to Quickbeam","Where Has Treebeard Gone?","Search for Treebeard in Fangorn Forest","Not knowing Treebeard has marched to war, Quickbeam's Huorn seeks to find the elder Ent in the forest.","DNT -- Players will not see","After arriving at a barren Wellinghall, Quickbeam's Huorn appears terrified that Treebeard is nowhere to be found. Its branches flail wildly as it desperately seeks him out nearby.\
\
Despite knowing the elder Ent has marched to war, you have no means to communicate with the Huorn and decide to aid in its search."},
[14568]={"Deberías avisarle a Heleth que has ocultado sus huellas.\
\
Heleth Bach está en Lintrev","Heleth Bach te ha pedido que alises y ocultes cualquier rastro que pudiera haber dejado junto al río.\
\
El río se encuentra al noroeste de Lintrev, en el sur de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","La seguridad de la pequeña aldea de Lintrev depende de que sus habitantes no dejen ningún rastro de su paradero para que lo encuentren sus vecinos indeseables.","Regresa con Heleth","Huellas hobbit ocultadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Hola, hola! Soy Heleth. ¿Has bajado al río? Estuve allí hoy más temprano, ¡pero la gente grande más aterradora que he visto jamás bajó atronando por el camino! Me lancé a los arbustos y luego volví corriendo aquí tan rápido como pude.\
\
'Por desgracia, ¡olvidé ocultar mis huellas! Si bajas al río, ¿podrías borrar mis pisadas si las ves? La alcaldesa Dringarth insiste en que no dejemos rastro alguno donde la gente grande aterradora pueda vernos, pero estoy demasiado asustada como para volver allí yo misma.'","'¡Hola, hola! ¿Ya lo hiciste? ¡Oh, maravilloso! No habría podido pegar ojo si pensaba que esa gente grande desagradable del camino nos habría encontrado. ¡Vaya, tengo el estómago tan revuelto que no he comido en por lo menos una hora!'","Oculta huellas hobbit (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dónde Pisa Heleth"},
[14569]={"You discover a patch of blackened roots","You have come upon a sickened stump covered in writhing worms","Tell Greenroot you wish to help","As you approach this Ent, you feel the weight of a heavy grief upon the air around him, like a grey mist. This Ent withers under the powerful sadness.\
\
It is clear that the sadness consumes the Ent Greenroot, but you cannot help him if you do not know why.\
\
You wait a moment for a memory to be impressed upon you, but Greenroot has retreated into his own slow thoughts.","Something near Greenroot has made him sad, but he has no memory to impress upon you.\
\
You should investigate nearby to see what has caused this Ent to wither under such a heavy cloud.","Greenroot is outside of the entrance to the Black Heart in Fangorn.\
\
You should return to Greenroot to tell him that you understand his pain, and wish to help if you possibly can.","Investigate near Greenroot (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","You discover a dead young Huorn, fallen prey to some terrible anguish","The Ent Greenroot is tremendously sad, withering under the weight of his grief. If no one intervenes, you worry he will slowly become naught but dead wood.","You tell Greenroot that you saw the state of his herd: corrupted, twisted, polluted, blackened by evil influences in the forest. He closes his eyes sadly as you recount what you saw.\
\
You want nothing more than to help this lonely Ent be free from the pain of watching his trees turn so evil.","Where Light Cannot Shine","You have discovered the corpse of a fell-looking, blackened Huorn"},
[14570]={"'No pareces ser de mucha utilidad, ¿verdad? ¡Ve a encontrar esa lanza!'","'¡Mi lanza! ¡Juro que ninguna otra vuela tan certera! Habría sido terrible no volver a verla jamás. Veamos ahora ese colmillo.\
\
'Ah, es magnífico, ¿verdad? Mira el… un momento. ¡Mira esto! ¡Hay marcas grabadas en el colmillo! No logro entenderlas, eso sí.\
\
'¡Bah, no importa! Aun así será un gran trofeo.'","Devuelve el colmillo y la lanza a Sigrík","Encuentra al mamut atravesado por la lanza de Sigrík","Sigrík se encuentra en Zigilgund, al norte del cadáver del mamut.\
\
Deberías devolverle la lanza y el colmillo a Sigrík.","Sigrík perdió su lanza mientras cazaba mamuts.","Donde mueren los Norsu","'¡Perdí mi lanza clavada en el costado de un mamut! ¿Puedes creerlo?\
\
'Estaba cazando cerca, justo al sur de aquí, cuando vi una auténtica maravilla de bestia, con un par de colmillos impresionantes, y pensé que uno de ellos quedaría como un magnífico trofeo sobre la repisa de mi chimenea, en casa.\
\
'Hice un buen lanzamiento, recto y certero, pero la estúpida criatura salió corriendo con mi lanza aún incrustada en el costado, dejándome atrás como un necio. ¿Podrías ir a buscarla? Me sorprendería que la bestia hubiera llegado muy lejos. ¡Si encuentras su cadáver, tráeme también uno de sus colmillos!'","'¡Lo que quiero es mi lanza y uno de los colmillos de ese mamut! Busca en el lugar al que van a morir, al sur de aquí.'","El mamut debería encontrarse en algún lugar al sur de Zigilgund.\
\
Sigrík te ha pedido que encuentres su lanza perdida, que debería estar clavada en el cadáver de un mamut. También te ha pedido que recojas uno de sus colmillos.","Has recogido la lanza y el colmillo de mamut"},
[14571]={"Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, south of Helstor.\
\
You should bring the statue to Céola at once.","'¿Tienes algo para mí?'","In the brigand's treasure-cave at Helstor, you found a golden statue of a horse and rider, which bears a strong resemblance to the Rohirrim.","This golden statue of a horse and rider bears a strong resemblance to the Rohirrim. Céola will almost certainly wish to see it.","'What have you found there? What? I cannot believe this!\
\
'This statue was made by the smiths of Gondor and given to Eorl the Young in honour of the aid he gave at the Field of Celebrant. It has long been an heirloom of the Eorlingas!\
\
'How did this come to be in the hands of the brigands? Ah, that I think I can answer well enough: Gríma Wormtongue, no doubt. He probably gave it to Hafoc as a reward for betraying us all....'","Where Now the Horse and the Rider?","Bring the statue to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands"},
[14572]={"Return to Tálbiral in Laivárth","Tálbiral has asked that you head south from Laivárth to an Orc camp called Mokh Grazádh and look for signs that they may be spreading the blight.","Arrived at Mokh Grazádh","Orcs killed in Mokh Grazádh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I welcome your return. What did you discover in Mokh Grazádh?'\
\
You tell Tálbiral of what you found in the camp.\
\
'So there were no signs of the Orcs being the cause of the blight rampaging more in recent days? The source must be elsewhere. I am glad that you investigated and thinned their numbers while you were there. They are still a dangerous force to be left unchecked so close to the grove.'","Reach Mokh Grazádh","'I have spotted Orcs to the south. I fear those foul beasts may be helping to spread this blight through Adagím.\
\
'Go to their camp, I believe it is known as Mokh Grazádh, and find proof of this if you can. They must have supplies or tools to handle this blight. If any Orcs try and stop you, put an end to them.'","Where Orcs Tread","Return to Tálbiral in Laivárth and let him know what you discovered of the Orcs plans in Mokh Grazádh.","Kill Orcs in Mokh Grazádh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orc supplies inspected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Inspect Orc supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14573]={"This cartrev has been burned to the ground","Patrol Cartrev Rurith","'It is good that Hamon's home remains whole, as does Emlun... I only hope Emlun escaped the wrath of the half-orcs. Alas for Rurith, Matho, and their families.\
\
'I thank you for your assistance, Duvodiad.'","The cartrevs of the Uch-lûth lie to the south of Lhanuch.\
\
Neirin Brehur has asked you to seek out the cartrevs of his people and learn if any survived the attacks of the half-orcs.","Patrol Cartrev Hamon","'Seek the cartrevs to the south and learn if any still remain there.'","'Marauders have come to our lands, killing our livestock and threatening our people. Smoke rises from the south, and I fear that it comes from our cartrevs, burned in the night by the half-orc invaders.\
\
'Glynn Brenin has forbidden our warriors from taking the field, fearing that the village itself might be burned, so I would ask you to seek out the cartrevs and see if anything remains.'","Neirin Brehur is at Lhanuch, north of the cartrevs.\
\
You should return to Neirin Brehur with news of your discoveries.","Neirin Brehur has asked that you ride out to the cartrevs south of Nan Laeglin and see if any of them have escaped destruction at the hands of the marauders that beset Nan Laeglin.","This cartrev appears to be abandoned","Where There is Smoke...","Patrol Cartrev Emlun","This cartrev remains inhabited","Patrol Cartrev Matho"},
[14574]={"Speak with Irsinith","'Oh, hello there. You say Tálbiral sent you?'\
\
You give the blight samples to Irsinith and explain that Tálbiral is in need of help. She inspects the sample.\
\
'I fear that it is as Tálbiral thought. The blight is deep in the roots of Laivárth, such as it is here. I do not know what can be done as I have tried everything to help Amûma to no avail. Unless we can stop the spread of this rot, all of Adagím will soon succumb to it.\
\
'I am sorry.'","You have arrived at the Hill of the Mother. Speak with Irsinith and show her the blight samples Tálbiral gave you from Laivárth.","'I fear my efforts here in Laivárth are futile. The grove appears to be succumbing to the blight in a manner similar to how Amûma has.\
\
'I ask that you take these samples and bring them to Irsinith. She is the warden of the Hill of the Mother and will want to know that the blight has spread deeper into the grove.\
\
'You may also be able to help her as you have helped me, ${CLASS}.'","Tálbiral has given you samples of the blight gathered in Laivárth and fears that the grove is succumbing to the blight. Bring the samples to Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother as she may be able to help.","Arrived at the Hill of the Mother","Where the Blight Runs Deep","Travel to the Hill of the Mother"},
[14575]={"¿Cuál Puso Primero?","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Wald Arenilla te ha pedido que devuelvas los huevos por él, para no ser descubierto. Debes colocar los huevos de vuelta en el orden en que fueron tomados, comenzando por el primero.","Colocaste el segundo huevo en el nido correcto","Wald Arenilla tomó una canasta de huevos de las gallinas premiadas de su padre, pero luego descubrió que tenían pollitos dentro.","'¡Hola! Me he metido en un buen lío; ¿crees que podrías ayudarme? Me colé y tomé una canasta de huevos cuando papá no estaba mirando... es muy quisquilloso con sus gallinas premiadas y no me deja cuidarlas. Solo quería un refrigerio junto al río con mis amigos, nada mas.\
\
'Bueno, después de escabullirme con los huevos me di cuenta de que tenían pollitos dentro. Papá ha intentado que sus gallinas premiadas pongan huevos desde hace mas tiempo del que puedo recordar; debe ser el nuevo gallo que consiguió en Bolgovado. No puedo volver y devolver los huevos, ¡pero quizás tú sí puedas! Papá se lastimó la pierna y hay tantos viajeros yendo y viniendo en busca de huevos que podrías colarte y reemplazar los que tomé.\
\
'Me puse tan nervioso intentando escapar con los huevos que olvidé de qué gallina los tomé. Puse los huevos en la canasta en el orden en que los tomé, así que todo lo que necesitas hacer es averiguar en qué orden los pusieron las gallinas.\
\
'Logré sacar a escondidas una página del diario de mi padre... puede escribir, sabes, me enseñó todas las letras... aunque no logro distinguir arriba de abajo en sus notas. ¿Quizás tengas mas suerte tú?\
\
'Ten cuidado al colocar los huevos de vuelta en los nidos... esas gallinas saben cuáles son sus propios huevos y sacarán rodando cualquiera que no sea suyo, y entonces tendrás que empezar de nuevo.'","Coloca el tercer huevo en el nido correcto","Colocaste el quinto huevo en el nido correcto","Wald Arenilla puede encontrarse en la Granja Arenilla, al norte y al este de Cavada Grande.\
\
Habiendo reemplazado todos los huevos, deberías regresar y hablar con Wald Arenilla.","Habla con Wald Arenilla","'¿Has averiguado qué gallina puso primero?'","'¿Pudiste devolver todos los huevos a los nidos? Odiaría que los pollitos no lleguen a nacer. Recuerda mirar las notas de mi padre si tienes problemas.'","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Coloca el segundo huevo en el nido correcto.","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Coloca el quinto huevo en el nido correcto.","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Coloca el cuarto huevo en el nido correcto.","Colocaste el primer huevo en el nido correcto","Colocaste el tercer huevo en el nido correcto","Coloca el cuarto huevo en el nido correcto","'¿Lograste hacer coincidir todos los huevos con sus gallinas? ¡No sé cómo agradecerte, ${PLAYER}!'","Coloca el segundo huevo en el nido correcto","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Coloca el tercer huevo en el nido correcto.","Colocaste el cuarto huevo en el nido correcto","Coloca el quinto huevo en el nido correcto","La gallina sacó el huevo rodando del nido","Coloca el primer huevo en el nido correcto"},
[14576]={"'It is good that Stanric has given you leave to do as you will. If only I had that liberty....\
\
'Ah well. Sabert and Tatwine are good men... and better yet, are not loyal to Sithric. They will accept your help more readily than the others if you wish to lend aid.'","'You are an admirable ${RACE}, ${PLAYER}! I wish Sithric had the wisdom to see what good could be done here if only he stepped out of our way!'","Sabert guards the north gate of Stangard, and Tatwine tends the stable near the Mead Hall, in Eorlsmead.\
\
You should assist Sabert and Tatwine with anything they might need that can be done without interference from Sithric.","Stanric has given you leave to do as you will in Stangard.","Tell Gadda of your successes in Stangard","Whispered Permission","Help Tatwine to better tend the horses","'Sabert guards the north gate, and you will find Tatwine at the stable.'","Help Sabert deal with the threat of vicious dogs in the plains","Gadda is near the Mead Hall in Stangard."},
[14577]={"Return to the lying slave","Under the signal flag, a slave of Nurn looks up at you with bright but pained eyes","'Ah, you return. You have looked and looked, yes? And you have seen. I see it is so! Kurtil, I am named. And you are... ${PLAYER}, yes? It is well. Now tell me what you know and what you have learned.'\
\
You tell the slave what Barathron thought they were and what he thought they might mean, and he frowns. You relate, to the best of your memory, what signal flags you found in the basin and a thin smile appears on his pained mouth. You get the uneasy impression that he may be learning more from you than you are from him.\
\
At last, he nods.\
\
'Keen eyes and swift legs. But are you help or are you hurt? Help, I think and no, no not cruel. Not... deceiving. Then I will offer help for your help. What I know of Udûn, so too will you know. And in truth, of Udûn I know much.'","DNT FLAG 3","DNT FLAG C","You should look for signal flags in the western half of the Udûn basin.","Whispers and Signs","'Good. Now, listen closely. If the whispers are true, there are signal flags placed around the near basin of Udûn. Taken together, these symbols and signs, understood only by the forge-workers of this place, convey a message.\
\
'For instance, a half-circle might be taken to mean dawn, or perhaps dusk, and three close lines might be taken for a meeting. A raised arm might be taken for taskmaster and one bent like a snake might be water - or drink. In truth, I know not.\
\
'If you will go and make a study of these banners, however, I feel certain that together we may get to the root of it and so discover what plans the lurking dwellers of this place are making behind our backs. It is sure to be something treacherous and harmful to Gondor!'","The Nurnhoth slave is lying on the southern edge of the Udûn basin, up atop a wooden structure.\
\
You should return to the slave of Nurn you found by the signal flag.","Found signal flags (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to Barathron","You should talk to Barathron in the Foothold camp in Udûn to learn more about the riddle he wishes to solve.","'A most intriguing riddle has come to us. Perhaps a riddle of great importance. Who can say? A dying Nurnhoth - those are the Mordor slave-men, you see - told us of a secret plan among the forge-labourers of Udûn. Stranger still, it is all arranged in a voiceless code!\
\
'The poor soul could tell us little else before he passed, save that the plan should take place soon.\
\
'How inconvenient that our Captain has not returned and that he left clear orders that we were to hold the camp until he did! No, Mulnír, I do not think he is lost or in peril. I fear what this plan will be. I fear that it will come and go before there is any chance to find it out. And what will happen if it does?\
\
'Ah, good ${RACE}, you will unravel this riddle for me, won't you? Someone must!'","Word of a secret meeting among the dwellers of Udûn has reached the Foothold camp.","DNT FLAG D","'If you will go and make a study of these banners, I feel certain we will solve the riddle of this meeting and what mischief it portends.'","DNT FLAG A","DNT FLAG B","'Know what that is?' \
\
His eyes turn up to the signal flag. He speaks in clean, confident Westron.\
\
'I would say that you do, yes. But... they tell no tales to you, no. Not yet, they do not. When you have seen them all and you have returned to me, then there will be much to say. Much to tell, yes? I think so.'","Find signal flags (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[14578]={"El aullido siniestro te da escalofríos","Después de encontrar un cadáver corrompido, pudiste disipar la voz maligna en el aire con una canción alegre. Deberías continuar hacia el este y buscar en las criptas cualquier otra cosa notable.","Los susurros inquietantes llenan tu corazón de temor","Has encontrado un cadáver corrompido rodeado de un resplandor verde y el sonido de una voz atormentada. Tal vez deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros.","Tu canción ha disipado la corrupción","Gíshgi is still distressed by the presence of the Dead in An Shêru and has asked you to re-enter the crypt below to see if you can find any explanation as to why they aren't at rest in their graves. The entrance to the Crypts of Gadim-ûn is at the north-western end of the hall.","Calma a los muertos angustiados","You have found a total of four corrupted corpses, each surrounded by a green radiance and the sound of a tormented voice. Each time, you were able to dispel the foul voice with a lighthearted song. You should return to Gíshgi in Gadim-ûn and tell her what you found.","'${PLAYER}, I loathe these wights so. Why are they tramping about instead of lying in their graves where they belong?\
\
'You are courageous and do not fear them as I do. Do you think if you entered the crypts below, you would find some clue as to why they are not at peace?'","Los susurros fantasmales te revuelven el estómago","Busca otra pista más al este","Gíshgi is still distressed by the presence of the Dead in An Shêru and has asked you to re-enter the crypt below to see if you can find any explanation as to why they aren't at rest in their graves. You should head east and search the crypts for anything notable.","Search for a clue to the east","Has descubierto un tercer cadáver corrompido. Deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros, como hiciste las veces anteriores.","Whispers in the Crypts","Ahora has encontrado tres cadáveres corrompidos, cada uno rodeado de un resplandor verde y el sonido de una voz atormentada. Cada vez, pudiste disipar la voz maligna con una canción alegre. Deberías viajar hacia el oeste y continuar buscando en las criptas.","Search for another clue to the south","You tell Gíshgi of the disturbing whispers and wailing you came across in the crypts, and how you were able to dispel them by countering them with a happier song.\
\
The woman gasps.\
\
'${PLAYER}, this must be what they call Ishími! The Anguished Wind. People have been claiming to sometimes hear it since Barkhûsh fell. I know not if it has any truth to it, but some say it is the voice of one who was a king in these lands, long ago.\
\
'I cannot imagine what that has to do with Barkhûsh, though. Thank you for your bravery!'","You have yet another corrupted corpse. You should again sing a lighthearted song to yourself to ward off the fell whispers.","Talk to Gíshgi","Después de encontrar dos cadáveres corrompidos, pudiste disipar la voz maligna en el aire con una canción alegre. Deberías viajar hacia el sur y continuar buscando en las criptas.","The wights in the Crypts of Gadim-ûn continue to encroach on the land of the living.","Los lamentos de agonía te aprietan el pecho de ansiedad","Has encontrado otro cadáver corrompido. Deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros, como hiciste la última vez.","Enter the Crypts of Gadim-ûn","Busca otra pista hacia el oeste"},
[14579]={"Talk to Ulf","Collect spoils and gold from Variags in Taur Drúadan (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Whispers in the Forest","'Ah, that ought to be enough...\
\
'Let us see what our friend here thinks of our offer!'","'Ah, ${PLAYER}. I have heard talk of these Variags we have encountered in our journey, and I have devised a plan that might allow us to gain more information about the cur that slew Léofdag. \
\
'Rumours are spreading that some of their number seem to have a tenuous allegiance with the Enemy. It is the thought of our scouts that they are sell-swords, and have no true interest in the fates of Gondor or Rohan.\
\
'If that is so, it may be possible to barter with a chief among them who knows more of our foe. Steal away the coins and spoils that the Variags have amassed, and bring them to me within their blockade. For my part, I shall find one of their chiefs and compel him to hear out our offer.\
\
'I know as well as you that these men are not to be trusted, but I would not lose a chance to learn more of Léofdag's killer. Fear not... if they do not accept our barter, we shall fight our way out side by side.'","'We have had much time to ponder our course, but tracking our foe shall prove difficult no matter the choice.\
\
'Many of our kinsmen have started through the winding paths of this forest, but we cannot follow them - not yet. We must learn more of our foe before we reach the Pelennor Fields, and on that, we are all agreed.\
\
'Hutha and I shall speak more on what else can be done, but for now, perhaps it is best that you hear Ulf out. Ulf has devised a cunning, but unlikely plan - yet, I believe with your aid, it may succeed.\
\
'Speak to him, and aid him if you might!'","Collected spoils and gold from Variags in Taur Drúadan (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Variags can be found at the Eastern Blockade in Taur Drúadan.\
\
Ulf has asked you to recover stolen gold and spoils of war from the Variags in hopes that he might barter for information with one of their number.","Talk to Burnoth at his camp in Taur Drúadan","Burnoth can be found at his camp among the War-stead of the King's Men in in Taur Drúadan.\
\
You aided Ulf in recovering vital information from the Variag lord, and should now report back to Burnoth before continuing your journey.","Ulf is at his camp within the War-stead of the King's Men.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to speak to Ulf about a plan he has devised to uncover more information about Léofdag's killer.","In their quest to discover the agent of the Enemy embedded within the Rohirrim, the Riders Three decide to take a different route through Taur Drúadan.","Ulf can be found beyond the Eastern Blockade in Taur Drúadan.\
\
Ulf has asked you to meet him beyond the Eastern Blockade between the Variag and Orc forces in hopes that he might barter with one of the Variags.","'I must admit, it puzzles me that one of the Enemy's men would surrender one of his allies for a modest bounty. Perhaps it is the way of these Variags... no true loyalty other than to their own wealth.\
\
'I know not if he spoke true, but we have no other course at the moment but to trust his words.\
\
'If this traitor intends to reunite with his master on the Pelennor, we must ride at once and keep a close watch on our kinsmen!'","Deliver the spoils to Ulf beyond the Eastern Blockade","As the Variag eyes you, Ulf indicates that you should remain and listen to what the Variag has to say","'Well, have you collected enough yet?'"},
[14580]={"Talk to Galadriel at Dol Dhannen","A weathered trap-door lies in the ruins of Dol Dhannen.\
\
You found a weather trap-door leading into Gostador. You should descend into Gostador beneath Dol Dhannen and search for Karazgar.","Enter the trap-door and search for Karazgar in Gostador","Whispers in the Pits","Galadriel can be found within Dol Dhannen.\
\
You have witnessed more of the shadowy impressions left upon the chamber by Sauron's evil and should now return to Galadriel.","Talk to King Thorin III","'Hail, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'You have been gone for some time! Tell me, what have you learned?'\
\
You tell King Thorin III of your adventures in Caras Galadhon and Dol Dhannen. You explain that your vision bore fruit, and that while Karazgar may still be among the peoples of the North, his intentions and purpose have been made clear. You also urge King Thorin III to consider the Lady of the Wood's warning and prepare Durin's Folk for battle against Vethúg Wintermind.\
\
'I see. I had wished it untrue, but it seems Vethúg is fated to come to Erebor. We cannot know when he shall strike, but for now, we must remain on guard.\
\
'I shall send word to the Queen Regent and the Elvenking, and we shall soon speak on what is to be done.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'Through the Eyes of Ravens'</rgb>","Gostador lies beneath the ruins of Dol Dhannen.\
\
You have come to Dol Dhannen and should now seek a way into Gostador.","Explore Dol Dhannen and find a way into the depths of Gostador","'We have come to Dol Dhannen, and it is as lifeless as the vision the Mirror revealed to me, but I would not have you search the ruins atop the hill.\
\
'Sigileth told me of the hidden chambers of Gostador beneath the tower where she dwelt after the battle against Mazog, and where Sauron regained his strength in the guise of the Necromancer. It is there you must go. \
\
'It is unlikely that the original passage into Gostador remains intact, so you will have to find another way into the pits of Dol Dhannen.\
\
'We shall remain on guard here. I shall send Sigileth to aid you if you do not soon return.'","You have discovered a weathered trap-door leading down into Gostador!","'I have gathered a small company to lead us to Dol Dhannen, ${PLAYER}. It is there you can seek the Weeping Warrior, Karazgar.\
\
'Lord Celeborn, King Thranduil, and I will guide you to the ruined hill. Sigileth has asked to accompany us on this journey as well, and I would not deny her in this.\
\
'Let us hope that whatever remains of legacy of the Necromancer in Dol Guldur will be at last ended this day.\
\
'We shall depart when you are prepared.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: When you accept this quest, you will immediately travel to the razed ruins of Dol Guldur, Dol Dhannen.</rgb>","'What did you find in the pits of Dol Dhannen, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You tell Lady Galadriel that the lingering evils in the Room of Voices revealed Karazgar's intentions: to subjugate the dragons and drive out the peoples of the North that he might rule it himself for however long his life may last deprived of Sauron's power.\
\
'It seems you were guided to this place by the hand of the Uttermost West, and even if he did not return as I suspected, something of Karazgar remained here and it was meant that you should discover it.\
\
'I have spoken to King Thranduil, and we are in agreement. You would do well to return to the lands of the North at once. The King Under the Mountain must be told of what has happened, and he must prepare his people for what is to come.\
\
'Be swift, ${PLAYER}.'","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain in Erebor.\
\
You have discovered that Karazgar did not return to Dol Guldur, but instead shadowy visions of his past remained among the lingering evils of Sauron within Gostador. You should return to King Thorin III and warn him that Karazgar may still lurk near to Erebor.","Galadriel is standing before Dol Dhannen.\
\
You have travelled to the ruins of Dol Guldur, now named Dol Dhannen, with Galadriel and her company. You should speak to her before beginning your search for Karazgar.","Although Galadriel remains doubtful that Karazgar has returned to the ruins of Dol Guldur, she has mustered a company to aid you in your search for the Weeping Warrior in the depths of Dol Dhannen."},
[14582]={"Hoping to learn more of what has happened in Lhingris in the aftermath of Sauron's downfall, Legolas has asked you to eavesdrop on the Orc-trackers of Rath Cail.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to the Orc-trackers near Lugvarg","Talk to Legolas in Rath Cail","'Hah! An Elf-warrior? I think the Orcs may have misjudged Master Samwise! Although, from the sound of it, the Orcs of Lugvarg may have found some of our friends' belongings left behind from when they passed through Mordor.\
\
'It is curious that the Orcs of this Kála-murg are unaware of the Silent One's treachery. They think him missing? I suppose they cannot spare much thought for him while a strange disease is spreading through the Orc-hold. The disease must be a potent one....'","Eavesdrop on Orc-trackers in Rath Cail","Whispers of the Enemy","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to the Orc-trackers near Kála-murg","'Be still, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Down in the vale, I see a few gatherings of Orcs positioned beside the road. Trackers of some kind, I believe. We shall have to move more carefully from here onward!\
\
'What do they search for, I wonder? They must realize it is too late to secure the Enemy's Ring!\
\
'Ah, but it seems they are more interested in talking than keeping to their posts. I see gatherings of Orcs by what I believe to be a watch-tower, by an Orc-hold of some sort, and another gathering of them beside the road in the vale.\
\
'Will you eavesdrop on them, my friend? We might learn more of what has happened in Lhingris since the Enemy's downfall!\
\
'I shall keep watch here and stop any other Orcs from approaching you!'","Eavesdrop on Orc-trackers near Lugvarg","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to the Orc-trackers in Rath Cail","Legolas can be found in the northern reaches of Rath Cail.\
\
You have carefully overheard the conversations of the Orc-trackers of Lhingris and should now return to Legolas.","Eavesdrop on Orc-trackers near Kála-murg","You can hear the hushed voices of the Orc-trackers. You should listen closely...","Orc-trackers can be found throughout Rath Cail, near the Orc-hold of Kála-murg, and near the watch-tower of Lugvarg.\
\
Legolas has asked you to eavesdrop on the Orcs in Rath Cail to learn more of what has happened in Lhingris since Sauron's fall.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You must select at least one of the gathered Orcs at each location to advance this quest.</rgb>"},
[14584]={"Se busca: suciedad repugnante de Imlad Morgul.","Entrega la suciedad repugnante en una caja de recolección","Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Suciedad repugnante","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir suciedad repugnante.","Suciedad repugnante recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge suciedad repugnante (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger suciedad repugnante. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: suciedad repugnante de Imlad Morgul. Recógela para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."},
[14585]={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles tocadas por la noche. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: pieles tocadas por la noche de Imlad Morgul. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Pieles tocadas por la noche recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: pieles tocadas por la noche de Imlad Morgul.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Pieles tocadas por la noche","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles tocadas por la noche.","Recoger pieles tocadas por la noche (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las pieles tocadas por la noche en un buzón de recogida"},
[14586]={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles endurecidas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles endurecidas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: pieles endurecidas de Imlad Morgul. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Entrega las pieles endurecidas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Pieles endurecidas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge pieles endurecidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Pieles endurecidas","Se busca: pieles endurecidas de Imlad Morgul."},
[14587]={"Recoger orejas con mechones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas con mechones.","Se busca: orejas con mechones de Imlad Morgul.","Se busca: orejas con mechones de Imlad Morgul. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Entregar las orejas con mechones en un buzón de recogida","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger orejas con mechones. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Orejas con mechones recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Orejas con mechones"},
[14589]={"The Pillar of the Hand lies to the east of Dagoras' camp.\
\
Dagoras has asked you to intercept a Dunlending messenger as he passes by the Pillar of the Hand. You should first eliminate the sentries by the Pillar.","Dagoras is encamped near the entrance to Nan Curunír, west of the Pillar of the Hand.\
\
You should return to Dagoras with news of your success.","Defeated Saruman's Messenger!","Dagoras has told you of a Dunlending messenger who is relaying information from Isengard to the clans in Dunland. The messenger is expected to pass by the Pillar of the Hand shortly.","'Have you dealt with Saruman's messenger? Good.\
\
'The less contact between Saruman's forces and those of the Dunlendings over the next few days, the better.'","Talk to Dagoras at his camp in Nan Curunír","'It seems that one of Saruman's lackeys is making for the pass out of Nan Curunír, presumably to bring a message to the Dunlendings.\
\
'I think it would be best for our Rohirrim friends if he did not arrive at his destination.'\
\
'He should be passing by the Pillar of the Hand shortly. Deal with the sentries there before he arrives and lie in wait for him there.'","Lie in wait by the Pillar of the Hand and defeat Saruman's messenger","'Have you dealt with Saruman's emissary yet?'","Saruman's Messenger Approaches...","Mensajero de la Mano Blanca"},
[14590]={"'Echad Mirobel está al oeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.'","'¡La Mano Blanca debe ser detenida a toda costa!'","Glavroleth está preocupado de que la Mano Blanca esté preparando un asalto a Echad Mirobel.","Mano Blanca, Forja Roja","'¿La Mano Blanca prepara una fuerza contra Echad Mirobel?\
\
'Traes malas noticias, pero quizás aún tenemos algo de tiempo para fortalecer nuestras defensas.'","'Las palabras del Uruk sobre un asalto a Echad Mirobel me preocupan, ${PLAYER}. Echad Mirobel no tiene suficiente fuerza para resistir un asalto de incluso una parte de las fuerzas de Saruman.\
\
'Debemos advertir a Echad Mirobel que la Mano Blanca se está preparando para moverse contra ellos. Viaja al oeste de Echad Dúnann por el camino de Nan Sirannon hasta Echad Mirobel y habla con Ornras. Hazle saber el peligro que ahora enfrenta.'","Echad Mirobel está al oeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.\
\
Se te ha instruido que adviertas a Echad Mirobel sobre la amenaza de la Mano Blanca.","Habla con Ornras en Echad Mirobel"},
[14591]={"Speak with Arvaethor.","'If only my father was able to command the Vale as he once did in his younger years, we may have more men alongside us now. No matter. Let us do what we must for Ethring and push these foul creatures back into the mountain!'","The Orc forces can be found in the Orc camp, Gríshru.\
\
Defeat the Orc forces.","Defeated Cave Troll (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated the White Mountain captain","'Good work my friend. These Orcs were no match for our blades. The Trolls were sizeable foes but we brought them down one by one.\
\
'Now they run into the mountain. Shall we enter the cavern to finish them off?'","White Mountain Plague","Defeat Cave Trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Arvaethor has asked you enter the Orc encampment with him and oust the forces from the Vale.","The Orc camp of Gríshru is located in the north-eastern part of Ringló Vale.\
\
You should enter Gríshru.","Enter the Orc encampment.","It looks as if the Orc forces were expecting you","Defeat the White Mountain captain","Speak with Arvaethor"},
[14592]={"'So, you have destroyed the Orc-laid traps of the Whitshaws? You have saved the beasts from a torturous death. The Orcs will now have a harder time of stealing Wildermore's wild game.'","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","Whitshaws: Cruelty Towards Beasts","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Orcs have laid traps throughout the Whitshaws to ensnare the beasts that roam upon those icy plains.","Destroyed a trap (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy traps (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Traps can be found on the icy plains of the central Whitshaws.\
\
You should destroy the traps laid by the Orcs.","Regresa con Ealswith","'I've heard from many folk that there are deadly traps sprung up all over the icy plains of the Whitshaws. The Orcs are surely hoping to ensnare the beasts that roam there, our own game! They have taken enough from us; I do not wish for our people to starve because the Orcs steal our beasts as well.\
\
'If you would be so kind as to destroy those traps, the people of Wildermore would be in your debt.'"},
[14593]={"The forces of Isengard can be found in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should ride to the Whitshaws and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.","Has derrotado a un enemigo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Núrzum is dead, but the enemy still roams free throughout much of Wildermore.","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","'Hail, ${PLAYER}! Your valour drove back Núrzum, but the forces of Isengard do not seem to care that their leader has fallen. They continue to swarm our lands in great numbers.\
\
'The enemy is especially strong in the Whitshaws today. Go there, and show them that Wildermore will endure!'","Regresa con Ealswith","'Well done! You have driven back the enemies of Wildermore for the day.'","Whitshaws: Driving Back the Enemy","Defeat enemies in the Whitshaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14597]={"Caught a Fish (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow time to expire</rgb>","Talk to Gyric to travel to the Whitshaws and speak with Rilbert","Obtained nets from the sack","'In the wake of Núrzum's rampage, my folk need the aid of skilled defenders to prevent such a tragedy from occurring again. I have devised trials to prove the worthiness of those who would come to our aid.\
\
'As you have no doubt learned, my people pride themselves on their horsemanship and mounted combat skills. If you truly wish to aid us further, test your skills by netting fish on the ice near the lake. We must ensure that this trial is capable of challenging a variety of participants, and I will even see to rewarding you if succeed. \
\
'Fish stranded on the ice can be captured in our nets by a person of suitable skill. We will provide you with small, medium, and large nets to be used from horseback. Catch as many fish as you can; success in this trial depends in the haul.\
\
'Speak with me again when you are ready to begin, and may fortune betide you.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest requires Mounted Combat</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>This is a timed quest. You must capture 30 fish in nets before time runs out.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","'So, Gyric sent you to be tested? Very well. Take these nets. You will have five minutes to gather up the fish which litter the shores of the lake amid the pools.\
\
'You will find that you must employ careful navigation as well as choosing the best net for each situation to succeed. The larger nets take more time to recover and cannot be wielded as frequently, so aim them carefully! One final piece of advice: take heed of the frost grims hiding among the pools. They are known to respond with great force against riders who approach them.\
\
'Good luck to you . . . I will begin counting your time immediately.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest requires Mounted Combat</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Note: This quest auto-completes upon completing the trial.</rgb>","Whitshaws: Mounted-fishing","Gyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to the Whitshaws and talk to Rilbert to begin your trial.","<rgb=#FF0000>Time has expired</rgb>","Fish of varying sizes can be found throughout the ice pools in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should spear as many fish as possible to gain points and complete your trial.","Use the sack of nets Rilbert gave you to obtain your skills, then begin catching fish along the course.","In the wake of Núrzum's rampage, the folk of Wildermore seek the aid of skilled defenders.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest requires Mounted Combat</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Note: This quest auto-completes upon beating the course.</rgb>","Use the net sack to obtain your skills","Fish Caught: (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You should speak with Rilbert when you arrive in the Whitshaws.'"},
[14598]={"The Warg-infested area of the Whitshaws can be reached by speaking with Dudoc in Forlaw.\
\
You should travel to the plains of the Whitshaws and defeat Warg-packs there, collecting the tails of larger Wargs as you go.","'Ah! Thank you for these trophies. They will fetch a handsome price.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Warg-packs have moved onto the lake's edge of the Whitshaws, killing the moose that roam there.","Dudoc is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Dudoc.","Whitshaws: Tails as Trophies","'If you plan to hunt any Wargs, make sure to collect their tails, for they make excellent trophies. Tails from larger Wargs are of course preferable.\
\
'Good luck to you, ${PLAYER}!'","Return to Dudoc in Forlaw","Collected a Warg-tail (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Are you ready to ride to the Whitshaws? The Warg-packs await your vengeance!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","Recoge colas de huargo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14599]={"Ride through the sixth red gate.","Ride through the fifth blue gate.","Ride through the eleventh red gate","Ride through the fifth red gate.","Ride through the fourth blue gate.","'It means much that Rilbert has endorsed your skills. I look forward to witnessing your talents myself!'","Gyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to the Whitshaws and talk to Rilbert to begin your trial.","Ride through the twelfth red gate","Rode through the fourth blue gate","Ride through the first red gate.","Ride through the fourth red gate.","Ride through the third blue gate.","Ride through the fourth red gate","Ride through the sixth blue gate","Ride through the eighth blue gate","Ride through the eighth red gate","Ride through the seventh red gate","Talk to Gyric or Rilbert","Rode through the second blue gate","Ride through the tenth red gate","Ride through the sixth blue gate.","Rode through the eighth red gate","Ride through the ninth blue gate.","Ride through the twelfth red gate.","Ride through the third red gate","Ride through the eighth red gate.","Ride through the ninth blue gate","Rode through the tenth red gate","'You should speak with Rilbert when you arrive in the Whitshaws.'","Ride through the sixth red gate","Rode through the ninth red gate","<rgb=#FF0000>You have failed the race</rgb>","Rode through the fifth blue gate","Rode through the seventh red gate","'Well done, ${PLAYER}. I will speak with Gyric on your behalf. You should return to him now.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Ride through the ninth red gate.","Ride through the seventh blue gate","Ride through the tenth red gate.","Ride through the first red gate","Rode through the sixth red gate","Ride through the second red gate","Ride through the second blue gate","Ride through the fourth blue gate","Rode through the first blue gate","Ride through the eighth blue gate.","Rode through the third red gate","'So, Gyric sent you to be tested? Very well. You will have one minute to reach each gate. Be wary of the storms, for they can blow you aside.\
\
'The Yst-arning will take you through several pairs of gates. The blue gates mark your way to the far side of the course, while the red ones indicate your path back. Do not miss any or you will risk failing your trial.\
\
'Good luck to you . . . I will begin counting your time immediately.'","Rode through the seventh blue gate","Rode through the first red gate","In the wake of Núrzum's rampage, the folk of Wildermore seek the aid of skilled defenders.","Rode through the fifth red gate","Rode through the twelfth red gate","Rode through the eleventh red gate","Rilbert is at the south end of the ice pools in the Whitshaws. Gyric is in Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Rilbert or Gyric regarding your performance in the race.","Ride through the third blue gate","Ride through the third red gate.","'In the wake of Núrzum's rampage, my folk need the aid of skilled defenders to prevent such a tragedy from occurring again. I have devised trials to prove the worthiness of those who would come to our aid.\
\
'As you have no doubt learned, my people pride themselves on their horsemanship and mounted combat skills. If you truly wish to aid us further, prove your skills by racing your war-steed through a course of storm-plagued pools in the Whitshaws. I call it the Yst-arning, the Storm-race.\
\
'Your skills will be judged worthy -- or unworthy -- by the amount of time that it takes you to finish the course. Speak with me when you are ready to leave for the Whitshaws.'","Talk to Gyric to travel to the Whitshaws and speak with Rilbert","Ride through the fifth blue gate","Rode through the ninth blue gate","Rode through the eighth blue gate","Rode through the sixth blue gate","Whitshaws: Yst-arning","Ride through the first blue gate.","Ride through the seventh blue gate.","Ride through the eleventh red gate.","Rode through the fourth red gate","Ride through the second blue gate.","Rode through the second red gate","Ride through the first blue gate","Ride through the seventh red gate.","Ride through the ninth red gate","Rode through the third blue gate","Ride through the fifth red gate","Ride through the second red gate."},
[14600]={"'¿Ya has encontrado mi faltriquera? ¿No? Entonces sigue buscando. Los Gauredain se encuentran al sureste de aquí.'","'¿Dónde está mi faltriquera?'","Recupera la faltriquera de Warstang de un ladrón guaradan","Warstang, el saqueador eglan que se aloja con los enanos en Zigilgund, ha sufrido el robo de la faltriquera que llevaba al cinturón.","Los ladrones guaradan pueden encontrarse al sureste de Zigilgund.\
\
Warstang te ha pedido que recuperes su faltriquera robada de manos de los Gauredain.","Warstang reside actualmente en Zigilgund.\
\
Deberías devolverle la faltriquera a Warstang.","Has recuperado la faltriquera de Warstang de un ladrón guaradan","'Espera… aquí está mi faltriquera. Entonces, ¿qué hay escondido en esta otra…?\
\
'¡Ay, por todos los dioses! Esta no es la mía: ¡es la faltriquera del ladrón guaradan! Será mejor que no mire dentro. De verdad no quiero saber qué guarda un Guaradan en su bolsa.\
\
'En cualquier caso, gracias por tu esfuerzo, ${PLAYER}. Lo menos que puedo hacer es darte algo de mi propia faltriquera…'","Lleva la faltriquera a Warstang","¿Quién roba al saqueador?","'No puedo creerlo, y la verdad es que resulta un tanto embarazoso, pero… ¡alguien me ha robado la faltriquera del cinturón! Un saqueador saqueado… no voy a oír el final de esto.\
\
'Si tuviera que apostar, pondría el dinero que ya no tengo a que el ladrón es un Guaradan. No hay muchas bestias por aquí con pulgares capaces de desenganchar una bolsa. Me pregunto incluso si se entrenan para robar…\
\
'Pero en fin, necesito recuperar mi faltriquera. ¿Me ayudarías otra vez? Puedes encontrar a los ladrones guaradan en los páramos al sureste de Zigilgund.'"},
[14601]={"Who Would Live In Grazadh-gropor?","Defeat wood-trolls in Grazadh-gropor","Completado","Completado.","Defeating wood-trolls throughout Grazadh-gropor would bring help to free folk who need the roots and herbs throughout the area to survive.","Grazadh-gropor will never be entirely safe, but your defeat of the wood-trolls will allow the free folk to forage beneath its canopy for much-needed provisions, for a time.","Trolls silvanos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Free folk have long sought rare roots and other necessities of life amongst the foliage of Grazadh-gropor.  Wood-trolls jealously protect this place from all whom approach it.","Defeat wood-trolls in Grazadh-gropor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Who would live in Grazadh-gropor?\
\
Wood-trolls. The answer, it seems, is wood-trolls. No one else would wish to live in such a place, though some free folk do seek to forage beneath its dark canopy for roots and other necessities of life.","Grazadh-gropor has long been home to foul wood-trolls. Free folk seek to forage beneath its dark canopy for roots and other necessities of life. Defeating the wood-trolls throughout the area would be a boon to those living nearby."},
[14602]={"'¡Has vuelto! ¿Cómo te fue?\
\
'¿Qué es esto? ¡Rechazado otra vez! Bueno... ¡no voy a rendirme! Si vuelves y le cuentas más de mis buenas cualidades, estoy seguro de que reconsiderará. ¡Seguro!\
\
'¿Le mencionaste lo trabajador que soy? Soy un tipo honesto y bueno con mis perros. Dicen que puedes juzgar el valor de un hobbit por cómo trata a sus perros, ¡y yo trato a los míos como reyes! Ve a ayudarla más en la granja y asegúrate de mencionarlo. ¡Como reyes!'","El campo de hierba para pipa de Asphodel está junto a su casa, directamente al oeste de su campo de trigo.\
\
La Viuda Froghorn te ha pedido que coseches algo de la hierba para pipa madura de su campo.","'Debo disculparme, pero ha sido difícil desde que perdí a mi Bodo. Si vienes a echar una mano, no te detendré.\
\
'La hierba para pipa está lista para cosechar, así que si aún quieres ayudar, puedes recogerla. Está justo allí, al otro lado de mi campo de trigo.\
\
'Pero debes saber que no cambiaré de opinión sobre el viejo Eldo Swatmidge.'","Entrega la hierba para pipa a la Viuda Froghorn","'¿Alguna buena noticia? ¿La viuda me dejará cortejarla?'","'Ahora, ten en cuenta que mi opinión sobre el viejo Eldo no ha cambiado... y puedes hacérselo saber.'","'Veo que has cosechado un buen manojo de hierba para pipa. Te lo agradezco: una mano amiga siempre se aprecia, venga de donde venga.\
\
'¿Dices que Eldo es un buen hobbit, sólido? Supongo que dirías eso, estando a su servicio.'\
\
Asphodel toma la hierba para pipa y te entrega una nota doblada y sellada. 'Llévala a tu buen y sólido amigo. ¡Y no la leas!'","Eldo Swatmidge es un granjero exitoso, pero está solo. Ha buscado tu ayuda para cortejar a su vecina, la Viuda Froghorn.","Hierba para pipa recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Mi hierba para pipa está plantada al otro lado de mi campo de trigo. Deberías encontrar algunas plantas maduras listas para cosechar.'","Recolecta hierba para pipa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega la carta de la Viuda Froghorn a Eldo Swatmidge","La granja de Eldo Swatmidge está por el camino al norte y al este de la granja de la Viuda Froghorn.\
\
Después de recolectar hierba para pipa para Asphodel, ella te entregó una nota y te pidió que se la lleves a Eldo sin leer el contenido.","Hierba para pipa de la Viuda Froghorn"},
[14603]={"'La granja de Asphodel está al oeste de aquí, más cerca de Entibo. Sube la colina hacia el oeste y gira al sur en la cerca de la cima. ¡No olvides hablar bien de mí cada vez que puedas!'","Peón de la Viuda","Eldo Swatmidge es un granjero exitoso, pero está solo. Ha buscado tu ayuda para cortejar a su vecina, la Viuda Froghorn.","La granja de la Viuda Froghorn está al oeste y al sur de la granja de Eldo Swatmidge.\
\
Eldo te ha pedido que ayudes en la granja de Asphodel Froghorn, aprovechando la oportunidad para decir algunas palabras amables sobre él.","'¿Quién eres tú? ¿Otro peón que Eldo envió para ayudarme? No necesito su ayuda, muchas gracias, ¡y que tengas buen día!\
\
'Por más que le diga \\qno\\q, ¡simplemente no se rinde! Te juro que solo hay una cosa que ama, y son esos perros que cría. ¡Si no ladra ni tiene cola para mover, no sabe ni por dónde empezar!'","Habla con Asphodel Froghorn en su granja","'¿No dirías que esta es una granja estupenda? Sí, la vida ha sido amable conmigo. ¡Mi único pesar es no tener a nadie con quien compartirla!\
\
'Creo que podrías ayudarme, si tienes ganas. La Viuda Froghorn vive en lo alto de la colina hacia el oeste, y es una dama encantadora, pero no quiere saber nada de que la corteje. ¡Le he estado enviando cartas desde hace tiempo, invitándola a tomar el té, a bailar, a cuidar de mi perro..... pero siempre se niega!\
\
'Ahora bien, la Viuda Froghorn —Asphodel es su verdadero nombre— siempre necesita ayuda en su granja. Tal vez, si le echas una mano y dices alguna palabra amable sobre mí de vez en cuando, ¡cambie de opinión! Ve hacia el oeste por la colina, luego gira al sur junto a la cerca en la cima. Su granja está en la encrucijada.'"},
[14604]={"Defeat dwarf-wights in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Angmarim have already raised wights from the ancient dwarves interred in the smaller tombs, like these ones at Akhaldarâg. They must be defeated and the fell spirits within banished, so the dwarves can return to their rest!'","Wights Within","Kyrstig is scouting outside Akhaldarâg.","'I have had nightmares before, ${PLAYER}, but none so bad as this. We must do what we can to keep our honoured dead from being used against us in this way! Such terrible enemies we face to conceive of such villainy!'","Defeated dwarf-wights in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The tombs at Akhaldarâg are located in the south-west side of the Pit of Stonejaws.","Kyrstig has asked you to defeat the risen dwarves in Akhaldarâg.","Talk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg"},
[14605]={"Espectros por todos lados","Espectros derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El Camino Verde es un antiguo camino que va desde las Tierras de Bree, al norte de Cardolan, hasta Tharbad, en la región meridional de Cardolan. Viajar por sus piedras rotas siempre ha sido difícil, pero últimamente lo es aún más debido a los peligrosos espíritus que acechan en las ruinas que bordean el camino.","Acaba con espectros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Debo admitir que no esperaba que regresaras. ...Ah, tan pronto, claro está.\
\
'Sin duda, nuestro progreso se ha visto bendecido por haber contado con alguien como tú.'","Vuelve con Coel","Deberías decirle a Coel que has derrotado a muchos tumularios.\
\
Coel está en la caravana, al sur de Andrath, en el norte de Cardolan.","Coel te ha pedido que acabes con los tumularios que hay en las ruinas a lo largo del Camino Verde.\
\
Los tumularios se encuentran en Dol Ernil y Gond Orchal, en el noreste de Cardolan.","'Puede que los bandidos nos hayan traído hasta aquí, pero nuestro camino hacia el sur también está bloqueado. Hay ruinas a ambos lados del Camino Verde y, últimamente, se han llenado de muertos vivientes. Si pudieras hacer que estos espíritus volvieran a descansar en paz, nos ayudarías un montón en nuestro viaje.'"},
[14606]={"Derrota linces en el Páramo Alto (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Canaddal está acampado en el Páramo Alto, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes regresar con Canaddal y comunicarle que has hecho lo que te pidió.","Habla con Canaddal","Los linces habitan en el Páramo Alto, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Canaddal te ha pedido que reduzcas su número para asegurar nuevamente el paso seguro por el Páramo Alto.","Los linces del Páramo Alto se han vuelto feroces, representando un peligro para quienes buscan refugio en Rivendel.","'Los linces siguen siendo una amenaza, pues son sigilosos y astutos. Aun así, te lo agradezco.'","Gatos Salvajes","'${PLAYER}, aunque mi mayor preocupación es proveer y equipar a nuestras visitas, hay algo más que me inquieta. Los linces que habitan en el Páramo Alto se han vuelto feroces —sin duda debido a la sombra que crece en el Este. Por desgracia, representan una amenaza considerable para quienes viajan a Rivendel en busca de refugio.\
\
'¿Te importaría cazar a estos linces por mí? Si su número se reduce, quizá sean menos propensos a atacar viajeros.'","Linces derrotados en el Páramo Alto (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14607]={"Wild Cats of the Brown Lands","Talk to Twiga at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}...perhaps we will not suffer so many casualties among our scouts now.'","Defeated wild cats in the Brown Lands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'So, Céola has asked you to lend us aid? I cannot say that your help is unwanted here, ${PLAYER}. Many of the border-guard throughout the region are genuinely roustabouts and ruffians sentenced to duty in these lands, but there are also many of us who were wrongly accused by Théoden King's counselor, Gríma Wormtongue.\
\
'I am responsible for the scouts, ${PLAYER}, and so I am very concerned with the wild cats which range the Brown Lands. They are vicious and attack our scouts without a second glance.\
\
'Would you hunt the cats and cull their numbers? Perhaps they will learn that Men do not provide the best meat.'","'Have you dealt with the wild cats yet?'","Wild cats can be found throughout the Brown Lands.\
\
Twiga asked you to cull the numbers of the wild cats which roam the Brown Lands, perhaps impressing the fear of Men upon them.","Defeat wild cats in the Brown Lands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Twiga is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should return to Twiga with a report of your deeds.","Twiga is concerned about the wild cats that range the Brown Lands. They are vicious and attack the Rohirrim scouts without a second glance."},
[14609]={"Place your lasso around the neck of a wild horse","Wild Horses","The wild horses can be found at the base of the cliff south-west of Cliving.\
\
Gladsnel asked you to catch a wild horse and bring it back to Cliving.","A herd of wild horses has appeared at the edge of the plains below Cliving.","Gladsnel is in Cliving.\
\
Gladsnel will be pleased to hear that you caught a wild horse.","Talk to Gladsnel","The horse has been caught","'Horses are our lives. Without his horse, a man in these lands is nothing. With the Enemy encroaching, many good men have had their horses lost... or worse, killed. New horses are a premium and valuable commodity.\
\
'A herd has been spotted below the cliffs just to the south-west of here. They are all wild, and it will not be as easy as just putting a saddle on them. If you approach slowly, you will be able to slip a rope around one of them... then hold on and stay close. If you can keep nearby for long enough, he should tire, then come here.\
\
'Bring a horse back for us... it does not matter which one. Make sure you stay close and be careful... the young ones out there are skittish and apt to change directions quickly.'","The horse looks uneasy and skittish.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","'That is an impressive mare you brought back in. She has strong legs and intelligent eyes. She will do well in battle.'"},
[14612]={"Notas algo inusual cerca....","Has encontrado un extraño conjunto de huellas en el barro","Explora las ruinas del suroeste","Habla con Fuirgam en Ost Galadh","Wild Ruins","The Wild Ruins mark the remains of an ancient Silvan settlement, founded not long after Lothlórien itself. While the Malledhrim have retaken the large structure at the centre of the ruins, they have had neither the time nor the resources to spare to explore the remaining ruins on its outskirts.","'Welcome to Ost Galadh, ${PLAYER}. Once long ago it was an outpost of our kind, when this forest was still called Greenwood the Great -- but that time is long past, and the power of Dol Guldur is great here now.\
\
'While our forces have taken and secured this courtyard as a base to strike at Dol Guldur, we have neither the time nor forces to explore and secure the surrounding tangle of ruins and forest. In this, I am hoping that you can aid us.\
\
'If you can take the time to quickly scout the more extensive ruins immediately to our south and report back on what you find there, it would be most helpful. What we can see from here suggests that it is mostly inhabited by wild beasts -- but even they must be assumed to be servants of the Enemy in a place like this, so foray with care.'","Scout the south-east ruins","Explora las ruinas del sur","Has explorado las ruinas del sur","Fuirgam se encuentra en Ost Galadh, al norte de las Ruinas Salvajes.\
\
Deberías informar a Fuirgam de los resultados de tu exploración. En particular, puede que le interesen las extrañas huellas que descubriste durante tu viaje.","The Wild Ruins lie to the south of Ost Galadh.\
\
Fuirgam has asked you to keep an eye out for enemies out of Dol Guldur or anything else out of the ordinary in the Wild Ruins.","'There are a few among the Malledhrim -- Agorin among them, I believe -- who once called Ost Galadh home. How it must confound them now to return at last and stand within these ancient walls, remembering times of song and laughter long ago swallowed by darkness.\
\
'I do not envy them this bittersweet return.'","'So, the ruins are overrun with cruel and evil beasts, but little sign of goblins or Orcs? Good.\
\
'These solitary footprints you mention, though...those are of considerable interest to me. When Lord Celeborn dispatched me across the Anduin, he bade me keep watch for a strange creature he named 'Gollum'. More than once he was nearly captured on the outskirts of Lothlórien, but he slipped away each time. Celeborn suspected he may have crossed the river to avoid capture, and it appears he was right.\
\
'My sentinels claimed to have spotted a strange creature in the wild a few days ago -- they thought it a goblin, but were unable to capture it before it fled into the twisting ways of the Scuttledells. Your discovery tells me that our mysterious interloper was likely this Gollum creature. Would that we had laid hands upon him then!'","Has explorado las ruinas del sureste","Examina las extrañas huellas"},
[14613]={"Se busca: caparazones calcificados de los Valles del Anduin.","Tarea de la gente de las tierras salvajes: Caparazones calcificados","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger caparazones calcificados. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Caparazones calcificados recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir caparazones calcificados.","Recoge caparazones calcificados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega los caparazones calcificados en una caja de recolección","Se busca: caparazones calcificados de los Valles del Anduin. Recógelos para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."},
[14614]={"Tarea de la gente de las tierras salvajes: Esencias perdidas","Esencias perdidas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega las esencias perdidas en una caja de recolección","Recoge esencias perdidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger esencias perdidas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: esencias perdidas de los Valles del Anduin. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: esencias perdidas de los Valles del Anduin.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir esencias perdidas."},
