Entrega la carta a Brom. Se lo puede encontrar en la Cárcel de Bree.","'El refinado arte de la lucha no consiste solo en golpear al otro, ¿sabes? ¡Debes saber con cuánta fuerza pegarle y dónde!\
\
'Estos libros deberían ayudarte, como me ayudaron a mí. ¡Y te los venderé con un descuento muy atractivo!'",",\
\
¡Libros! ¿Quién los necesita? ¡Un buen Luchador, eso es! ¿No quieres perfeccionar tus técnicas? Regresa conmigo a la Cárcel de Bree y te ayudaré con tus estudios.\
\
¡Así es, dije estudios! Si quieres ser ${PLAYER:el segundo mejor Luchador[m]|la segunda mejor Luchadora[f]} de todas estas tierras (después de mí, claro), ¡vas a tener que hacer un poco de lectura!\
\
Brom Barbadehalcón","Lleva la carta a Brom Barbadehalcón en la Cárcel de Bree"},
[14800]={"Tu leyenda crece","'¿Sí? Ah, mi carta. ¡Es un placer conocerte por fin, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Es cierto que muchas lecciones solo pueden aprenderse sobre la cubierta de un barco, pero aun así, se puede aprender mucho estudiando los relatos de los grandes Marineros del mundo con los pies firmes en tierra. Tengo en mi poder varios libros que podrían ser de utilidad para un Marinero como tú. Quizá te ayuden, como me han ayudado a mí a lo largo de los años. Si deseas estudiarlos con detenimiento, te los ofreceré a un precio justo.\
\
'¡Puede que necesites el conocimiento que guardan cuando menos lo esperes!'","${PLAYER},\
\
Han pasado muchos años desde la última vez que oí hablar de un Marinero con tu habilidad, pero incluso a los más experimentados el Mar puede convertirlos en necios. Si deseas aprender las técnicas más refinadas del Marinero, ven a hablar conmigo en la Plaza del Enano de Bree.\
\
Mick Cabellofino","Mick Cabellofino te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en la Plaza del Enano de Bree.\
\
Entrégale la carta a Mick Cabellofino. Se encuentra en la Plaza del Enano, en Bree.","Has recibido una carta de Mick Cabellofino, un Marinero curtido de Bree.","Lleva la carta a Mick Cabellofino en la Plaza del Enano, en Bree"},
[14801]={"Habla con los habitantes de Hobbiton","'¿Una petición?¿Por qué quieren que firme algo tan estúpido?'","'¡Firmaré tu petición!'","'¿Qué quieres?¿Es que no ves que estoy preparando el festín de Yule de este año?'","'¿Una petición para cambiar al organizador de la Fiesta de Yule? ¡Por supuesto que la voy a firmar!'","'¡Dame tu petición para que la firme!'","Ve a mostrarle la petición a Lobelia","El Libro de Reglas de los Festivales explica como retirar de su 'puesto' a Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón, pero no será fácil.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","'¿Qué es eso?¡Pues claro que firmaré!'","Hobbiton se encuentra muy lejos, al este de Cavada Grande.\
\
Will Pieblanco te ha entregado una petición oficial y te ha enviado a Hobbiton para encontrar a diez habitantes que la firmen.","'Ah,¡Aquí está! El Libro de Reglas de los Festivales establece claramente que un organizador de festivales puede ser sustituido con una petición firmada por al menos diez personas que residan en el pueblo donde se celebra la fiesta en cuestión.\
\
'Toma, esto es una petición oficial. Si puedes encontrar diez residentes de Hobbiton que la firmen podremos sustituir a la actual organizadora'","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón vive en Bolsón Cerrado en Hobbiton.\
\
Ahora que tienes las diez firmas puedes entregarle la petición a Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón","'¿Has conseguido encontrar el modo de librarnos de Lobelia?¡Dame ese papel!'","'¿Una petición para cambiar al organizador de La Fiesta de Yule?¡Por supuesto que la voy a firmar!'","'¿Has conseguido encontrar la manera de librarnos de Lobelia? ¡Dame esa petición!'","'¿Qué me estás contando?¡Por supuesto que firmo tu petición!'","Yule está en peligro","'¿Una petición para cambiar al organizador de La Fiesta de Yule? ¡Por supuesto que la voy a firmar! \
\
'Esta Lobelia no hace más que causarnos problemas desde que se mudó a Bolsón Cerrado. Lo que daría por que el señor Frodo regresara.'"},
[14802]={"¡Has participado en el Festival de Yule!","Todos los días hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal. ¡Todos los días allí es Yule! Ven y únete a todo el mundo en Risco Invernal y completa una actividad del Festival de Yule. Tenemos un saco de regalos esperándote.","Habla con Mara Arenales","¡Completa una actividad del Festival de Yule en Risco Invernal!","'¡Bien hecho, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Ven y siéntate un momento junto al fuego. ¡Te has ganado este saco de regalos por todo el trabajo duro que has hecho hoy!\
\
'¡Vuelve mañana y habrá más regalos para ti!'","Todos los días hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal. ¡Todos los días allí es Yule! Ven y únete a todo el mundo en Risco Invernal y competa una actividad del Festival de Yule. ¡Tenemos un saco de regalos esperándote!","Festival de Yule (Diaria)","Participa en una actividad del Festival de Yule en Risco Invernal","Mara Arenales desea agradecerte por tu participación en el Festival de Yule hoy.","¡Enhorabuena, has llegado a Risco Invernal! ¡Particpa en cualquier actividad del Festival de Yule y consigue un saco de regalos!"},
[14803]={"¡El Festival de Yule ya está aquí!","Visita la encantadora tierra de Risco Invernal donde está teniendo lugar lo mejor del invierno y muchas cosas especiales. ¡Date prisa en venir!","El Festival de Yule es una época de celebraión y alegría. Ven a Risco Invernal y únete a las festividades. Bebe, come y sé feliz.\
\
¡Feliz Yule!","¡Completa para recibir un mapa a Risco Invernal!","Completa para recibir un mapa a Risco Invernal en Risco Invernal."},
[14804]={"Entrega 2500 brasas de encantamiento a Calúrmin en Sul Madásh","En la época de Yule, reflexionamos sobre nuestras virtudes.","Yule: Brasas de virtud","Entrega 2500 brasas de encantamiento a Mara Arenales en Farol Escarchado","'Permite que las brasas de Yule enriquezcan tu naturaleza virtuosa.'","¡Celebra Yule!","'En la época de Yule, las llamas de nuestras virtudes arden brillantes.'"},
[14805]={"'Durante la época de Yule, reflexionamos sobre nuestras virtudes: las hazañas valerosas que hemos logrado y las alegrías que hemos compartido en estos días festivos.'","Entrega 10 Mûr Ghala Sârzai a Calúrmin en Sul Madásh","Entrega 10 bolas de nieve perfectas a Mara Arenales en Farol Escarchado.","Durante la época de Yule, reflexionamos sobre nuestras virtudes.","'Celebremos la época más alegre del año.'","¡Celebra Yule!","Yule: La época de la virtud"},
[14806]={"'Lobelia ha estado yendo y viniendo por asuntos relacionados con festivales, pero no he oído cómo consiguió el trabajo.'","'¡Hola! Supongo que has venido por los rumores, ¿verdad? Pues me temo que son ciertos; ¡Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón es la organizadora oficial del banquete de Yule de Hobbiton! ¡Es terrible, simplemente terrible! Ya ha anunciado que en el banquete solo tendremos verduras de la cosecha. ¡Qué descaro el de algunas personas!\
\
'Lobelia también nos dijo que deberíamos terminar el festival antes de tiempo este año, con todos los gamberros que han estado viniendo... dice que no es seguro para la gente decente quedarse despierta hasta tarde al aire libre. Nada más que verduras y a la cama temprano... ¿qué puede hacer un hobbit respetable?\
\
'Además, nadie en Hobbiton sabe con certeza cómo obtuvo ese título. Durante años, el viejo Loco Bolsón ocupó el puesto, y a su vez Frodo Bolsón lo tomó después de su desaparición. Algo no cuadra en todo este asunto. ¿Crees que podrías ayudarnos a solucionar las cosas?'","Penas de Yule","'Ya es bastante malo que Lobelia haya puesto sus manos sobre la casa del viejo señor Bilbo y se haya dedicado a amenazar a sus vecinos y demás, ¡pero ahora se ha hecho la organizadora oficial de Yule! Arruinará las fiestas, no hay duda.\
\
'Ese Lotho suyo no soporta las bebidas ni las fiestas, y ella le quiere tanto que seguro que lo estropeará todo por él. ¿Qué es una fiesta de Yule sin una buena jarra, pregunto yo? ¿Y qué es toda esta tontería de terminar la fiesta antes de tiempo este año?\
\
'Mal asunto, ${PLAYER}. Recuerda mis palabras, lo arruinará para todos. ¿Quizás podrías encargarte del problema en nombre de nosotros, los hobbits de Hobbiton?'","'La vieja Lobelia ha estado molestando a los alguaciles para que mantengan el orden durante la fiesta de Yule de este año. ¿Quién la nombró jefa, de todos modos? Bueno, supongo que el alcalde Pieblanco, pero eso no significa que me guste.\
\
'¡Quiere que todas las posadas cierren durante la fiesta de este año y planea tomar té en lugar de cerveza! ¿Puedes creerlo? Bueno, abierto o cerrado, estaré aquí mismo en La Mata de Hiedra durante Yule.\
\
'¿Quizás podrías preguntar por ahí y averiguar cómo se las arregló Lobelia para ganarse el favor del viejo Pastelón?'","'Después de todo el alboroto que armó por mis pasteles, Lobelia fue nombrada organizadora oficial de Yule. ¡Ahora quiere dejar mis pasteles completamente fuera del banquete! No suelo presumir, pero mis pasteles son muy apreciados en Hobbiton, y no me parece justo que los dejen fuera... ¡para reemplazarlos por verduras!\
\
'Estoy segura de que Opal Buenavista la instigó a este despropósito... nunca le caí bien. Bueno, puedo lidiar con ella, pero ¿quién va a lidiar con Lobelia?\
\
'¿Quizás podrías averiguar cómo consiguió ese puesto y hacer algo al respecto? ¡Sería una bendición para todo Hobbiton si pudieras!'","'¿La fiesta de Yule? Lotho Sacovilla-Bolsón nos invitó personalmente a mi padre y a mí, pero no entiendo por qué le contaría algo más a alguien como tú.\
\
'¡Ahora vete! Tengo cosas importantes que hacer en el molino sin que gente como tú se meta en mis asuntos.'","El molino de Arenas está al norte del puente en Hobbiton.\
\
El comportamiento inusual de Ted Arenas podría sugerir la idea de investigar el molino de Arenas en busca de algo fuera de lo común.","'¿El puesto de Lobelia como organizadora de Yule? No, no he oído nada sobre cómo lo consiguió.'","'Es un día triste, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}. Pensaba que habría un flujo constante de pedidos desde y hacia Bolsón Cerrado cuando Lobelia fue nombrada organizadora de Yule, pero no ha habido correo alguno; ni cartas, ni proveedores, ni regalos, ni nada.\
\
'Bueno, Hobbiton lo pasará mal este año si Lobelia permanece en su puesto. ¿Qué será del banquete de Yule? Es una lástima.\
\
'Oye, ¿quizás podrías investigar su nombramiento? Me huele un poco raro... con todo el alboroto en la Cuaderna del Sur y este jefe comprando tierras en la Cuaderna del Norte. Sería bueno tener algo que celebrar, ¡y que Lobelia fuera destituida de su puesto sin duda serviría a tal propósito!'","'Lo siento, no he oído nada.'","Encontraste una invitación","'¡La fiesta de Yule de este año será sencillamente maravillosa! La mejor que se haya celebrado en mucho tiempo; al menos, mejor que cualquiera que haya planeado el viejo tonto de Bilbo, eso seguro.'","'¿Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón está intentando engañar a Hobbiton privándolos de su fiesta de Yule? Me encantaría ayudar, pero me temo que no puedo hacer nada al respecto.\
\
'Lobelia vino hace menos de un mes buscando las leyes relativas a las fiestas locales de Hobbiton. Si no recuerdo mal, la ley de Hobbiton dice: Quien resida en la Colina de Bolsón Cerrado será responsable de la planificación y coordinación de todas las fiestas y actividades festivas locales y presidirá dichas fiestas en ausencia del alcalde.\
\
'Esta ley es un vestigio de cuando la familia Bolsón era la principal residente de la colina. Como la ley no se ha modificado ni se ha nombrado a un nuevo planificador, simplemente no puedo hacer nada.'","'¿Te has enterado? ¡La vieja Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón se ha hecho nombrar organizadora oficial de Yule este año! ¡Es terrible te digo!. El viejo Bilbo al menos sabía organizar un banquete estupendo -- aunque un poco raro -- pero Lobelia...\
\
'¡Quiere servir verduras y té! Está bien para una fiesta en el jardín, ¿pero para un banquete de Yule? ¡Me atrevo a decir que es un escándalo!\
\
'Apuesto a que es obra de Lotho. Necesita una buena lección, pero supongo que nadie tiene el valor. ¿Quizás podrías hablar con el viejo Pastelón, el viejo Pieblanco, el alcalde, para que busquen a otra persona?'","'Lo siento, pero no he oído nada sobre cómo Lobelia consiguió el puesto de planificadora de Yule. \
\
'¿Qué haremos? ¡Si Lobelia se sale con la suya, Yule se arruinará!'","Pregunta entre los habitantes de Hobbiton para obtener una explicación del nombramiento de Lobelia como organizadora de Yule","Parece que Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón es la organizadora de Yule en Hobbiton.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","'He oído un par de cosas, pero no soy de los que difunden rumores.\
\
'Pero si tanto quieres saberlo, oí que le pagó a viejo Pastelón en Cavada Grande para conseguir el puesto.'","'Si necesitas ayuda para buscar información, tal vez pueda ayudarte después de un par de pintas más.'","'Solo he oído que todos debemos comer verduras y descansar bien por la noche. ¡Qué descaro!'","'Hace quizás un mes, Lobelia subió en una carreta tirada por un poni hasta Cavada Gande, pero eso es todo lo que sé.'","'Ya es bastante difícil administrar un establo en la Comarca, pero cuando supe que Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón había sido nombrada organizadora oficial de Yule este año, casi me subo a uno de mis ponis y salgo de Hobbiton a toda velocidad. Es una broma de mal gusto, si me preguntas. ¿Qué bien puede salir de esto?\
\
'Lobelia tiene la misma alegría y amabilidad que un huevo podrido. Huele mal, te lo aseguro, y los rumores sobre sus planes para el banquete huelen aún peor.\
\
'¿Quizás podrías investigar su nombramiento? ¡Tiene que haber un error; estoy seguro!'","Habla con Will Pieblanco","'¡Márchate! ¿No ves que todavía tenemos mucho que planificar antes de la fiesta de Yule?'","'¿Lobelia? Oí que andaba metida en líos por ahí en Cavada Grande... Seguro que así fue como consiguió el puesto.'","Investiga el molino de Arenas en busca de cualquier cosa fuera de lo común","'¡Me parece maravilloso que Lobelia haya sido nombrada la organizadora oficial de Yule este año! Tiene una cabeza muy sabia. Sé que Lotho ha estado por ahí, gastando mucho dinero... ¡Seguro que es para el banquete!\
\
'Estoy segura de que todos esos rumores de que Lobelia quiere verduras, té y acostarse temprano para el banquete son una tontería. Al fin y al cabo, Lobelia es una hobbit... ¿qué más podría pedir una hobbit que un maravilloso banquete?\
\
'Bueno, estoy segura de que todos esos tontos que le ruegan al viejo Pastelón que quite a Lobelia de su puesto solo están celosos. ¿No opinarás tú como ellos, verdad?'","'¡Callarme para Yule, eso es lo que quiere hacer! ¿Quién? ¡Pues esa Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón! ¡La nombraron organizadora oficial de Yule, aunque no lo creas!\
\
'¿Qué es una fiesta sin alegría? ¿Y cómo se consigue alegría sin una posada? Es un terrible malentendido... ¡tiene que serlo!\
\
'¿Quizás podrías ir a averiguar la verdad detrás de estos rumores? ¡Es una locura, te lo digo!'","Se te ha pedido que preguntes entre los habitantes de Hobbiton para obtener una explicación sobre el nombramiento de Lobelia como organizadora de Yule.","Will Pieblanco se encuentra en la Alcaldía en Cavada Grande, muy al oeste de Hobbiton.\
\
Debes informar de tus hallazgos a Will Pieblando, el alcalde de la Comarca."},
[14807]={"Speak with the farmer outside of Ingar-garâsh","Return to Numûru with a bowl of nakhód júra","Add in water, the stew ingredients, and Numûru's spices to the cauldron.","Numûru has requested your aid in making his infamous stew for the camp.","Gather wood for a fire near Sâkhazai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Add a nearby cauldron to the roaring fire","Gather wood for a fire near Sâkhazai in Kighân. Sâkhazai is located north-west of Ingar-garâsh.","Speak with Numûru in Ingar-garâsh","Make a camp-fire in Ingar-garâsh","Defeated oryx near Sâkhazai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I can't believe it is you, ${PLAYER}! This calls for a feast! If you give me a hand, I'll teach you how to make Zajâni stew, nakhód júra. It tastes better than it smells.'","Taste the stew in Ingar-garâsh","Gathered wood for a fire near Sâkhazai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'It tastes good, right?! Good enough for camp food, anyway. It's always better when you make it yourself.'","The smell bubbling up is quite strong and musky, though not altogether unpleasant","Added in stew ingredients to the cauldron","Harvest chickpeas from Aphadar's field outside of Ingar-garâsh.","Harvested chickpeas from Aphadar's field (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Make a camp-fire within Ingar-garâsh.","Taste the stew in Ingar-garâsh.","Defeat oryx near Sâkhazai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'This is excellent! So very fresh! Now we must build a fire and add the special herbs I've gathered!'","Add in stew ingredients to the cauldron","Harvest chickpeas from Aphadar's field (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The camp-fire roars to life!","Speak with the farmer Aphadar outside of Ingar-garâsh to harvest chickpeas for the stew.","Stir the stew in Ingar-garâsh","'I have no quarrel with Mizâdi or her soldiers. I have seen precious few brigands near Ingar-garâsh since her forces arrived.\
\
'Yes, you may take some of my chickpeas for your stew, with my blessing, friend.'","Add a nearby cauldron to the roaring fire in Ingar-garâsh.","Return to Numûru with a bowl of the completed nakhód júra stew in Ingar-garâsh.","Defeat oryx near Sâkhazai for their meat. Numûru is making his famous stew, nakhód júra, and needs oryx meat for it. Sâkhazai is located north-west of Ingar-garâsh.","The stew isn't bad - it tastes strongly of cardamom and ginger","Return to Ingar-garâsh and tell Numûru you have collected the necessary items.","Zajâni Stew","Stir the stew in Ingar-garâsh."},
[14809]={"You hear not the sound of conflict, but the sound of lives being lived","When you arrive, Prince Ingór sits confidently upon the throne","'Oh, I am just testing it out. This is not my throne to claim... yet. Fine craftsmanship! You and Rísti Graver have done well! I and all the Zhélruka give you our respect and thanks on this day.\
\
'Hmm, do you hear that? Do you see that? Listen well to Máttugard, and truly look out from the heights. Something has changed.'","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>listen</rgb> to the sounds of Máttugard","'What is this? You say the throne of Zidir-nesad has been restored? This is a momentous day indeed! I shall depart for the throne immediately. Meet me there, ${PLAYER}.'","'It is as the text described, a simple and beautiful throne, illuminated by power and compassion.\
\
'We should send word to Prince Ingór. He has done much to keep safe the throne and the halls near the Steepset. He will be pleased to gaze upon the throne restored.'","Talk to Prince Ingór at Vérnozal","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> out over Máttugard at the Steepset","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Talk to Rísti Graver","<rgb=#FF0000>Listen</rgb> to the sounds of Máttugard at the Steepset","Examine the fully restored throne","The Steepset can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> out over Máttugard at Steepset.","Return to the throne of Zidir-nesad","Prince Ingór can be found at Vérnozal in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Prince Ingór.","'${PLAYER}, it is hard to believe but my eyes do not deceive me. The throne of Zidir-nesad has been restored. Let us admire our work.\
\
'Yes, I say ours, for this was as much your doing as it was my own!'","The Steepset can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>listen</rgb> to the sounds of Máttugard at the Steepset.","You begin to see a home for the Zhélruka, for all dwarves, in this Mighty Court","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should return to the Throne of Zidir-nesad.","'It has been a pleasure working with you. I am sure there is more work in Gundabad for me, and for you as well!\
\
'May our paths cross again, friend ${CLASS}. Take care of yourself.'","The throne has been restored, as impressive as when it was newly-made","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> out over Máttugard","Zidir-nesad, the seat of Gundabad's lord, has been restored.","Zidir-nesad: Epilogue","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should examine the fully restored throne.","Talk to Prince Ingór upon the throne at Steepset","Prince Ingór can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Prince Ingór."},
[14810]={"A silver drake can be found in the Welkin-lofts.\
\
You should collect the horn of a silver drake for Mangur Bentpenny.","Rísti Graver, the greatest foreman of the Ironfold, has learned the location of the sacred Jewel of Abhâr. While the jewel has been found, it will take a skilled hero to recover it and return it to the throne! You should seek out Rísti Graver as soon as you are able.","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should add the Jewel of Abhâr to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","'What is it you want, stranger? The Jewel of Abhâr? Bah, is that what this stone I found is called? Sounds important! Sounds even more important if you've come asking about it, I think!\
\
'Do you expect me to just give it to you? I lay claim to it after all, found it fair! If you want this jewel, then what are you going to do for me? Hmm, let me think....'\
\
'Aha! Yes, yes, I've got just the thing! I've always wanted the horn of a silver drake! They are rare beasts, but I've seen one or two here in the Welkin-lofts. You get me the horn of a silver drake, and then... then we'll talk. Not before!'","Collect the horn of a silver drake","<rgb=#FF0000>Give</rgb> the silver drake-horn to Mangur Bentpenny","Collect Iron Crown treasures (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you for retrieving the Jewel of Abhâr, ${PLAYER}, for the orange light that shines from this gem symbolizes reason, and if there is one quality that best describes the dwarves, it is that one!\
\
'It is true, my friend. I hope you do not think all dwarves act without thought, for when something is of great importance to our people, I assure you there is much consideration that goes on, just beneath the surface. Indeed, some dwarves may do much of their thinking out loud, as it seems your friend the Dourhand may have done.\
\
'I am glad you endured the tasks of Mangur Bentpenny, my friend, for now the Jewel of Abhâr has been restored to its proper place in the throne! And that is reason enough!'\
\
Rísti Graver chuckles to himself.\
\
'Just my little joke, ${PLAYER}. Thank you again.'","Talk to Rísti Graver","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Abhâr","Mangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>give</rgb> the silver drake-horn to Mangur Bentpenny.","The sacred Jewel of Abhâr has been found.","Talk to Mangur Bentpenny","Collected Iron Crown treasures (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected the horn of a silver drake","Added the Jewel of Abhâr to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Mangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts.\
\
You should talk to Mangur Bentpenny about the Jewel of Abhâr.","Mangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>give</rgb> the Iron Crown treasures to Mangur Bentpenny.","'My, this is a lot of treasure! Look at all these trinkets and gems! I almost feel badly, trading you this one jewel for all of this treasure... but a deal is a deal!\
\
'Have your jewel and be on your way. Hmm, I might just pack it in. With all these riches, I could find a quiet mountain and live out the rest of my days in peace....\
\
'Well, it's been nice trading with you, stranger!'","Add the Jewel of Abhâr to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Talk to Mangur Bentpenny about the Jewel of Abhâr","'The sacred Jewel of Abhâr has been found... but there is a problem. It has been found by a Dourhand, Mangur Bentpenny, in the Welkin-lofts! I ask you to find a way to retrieve it from this Dourhand without causing too unpleasant an incident.'","Mangur Bentpenny reluctantly hands you the Jewel of Abhâr","Mangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts.\
\
You should talk to Mangur Bentpenny.","'What? You got the horn of a silver drake?'\
\
Mangur Bentpenny mumbles under his breath.\
\
'This fool should be dead.'\
\
Mangur Bentpenny clears his throat and continues speaking to you.\
\
'Hmm, I can see you really are serious about this jewel. Your desire to own this gem makes it more valuable, however. The price has gone up! The horn you gave me is not a fair trade. I need something more....\
\
'Ah, Iron Crown treasures! My friends and I have been trying to acquire the Iron Crown treasures hidden in the Welkin-lofts, but to no avail! If you can find and bring us these hidden treasures, then I will relinquish the jewel to you. You have my word... again!'","Iron Crown treasures can be found in the Welkin-lofts.\
\
You should collect Iron Crown treasures for Mangur Bentpenny.","<rgb=#FF0000>Give</rgb> the Iron Crown treasures to Mangur Bentpenny"},
[14811]={"'The sacred Jewel of Abnâh! It has been found in the Deepscrave, upon the crown of a greedy Orc named Nakhauga whose fingers on the sacred stone cannot be further allowed! I ask you to retrieve it.'","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should add the Jewel of Abnâh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","'I thank you for retrieving the Jewel of Abnâh, one of the seven sacred jewels of Zidir-nesad. I have spent so long studying the meaning of these gems, but to finally see this one restored lightens my heart and fills me with a happiness I find difficult to explain.\
\
'How blue shines the light reflecting from it! This gem symbolizes the grand traditions of the dwarves, and reminds us to remember the places from which we came. The return of this jewel will undoubtedly boost the spirits of all who see it, letting them know the rightness of our cause. The Mountain-home welcomes we who come back to it.'","Add the Jewel of Abnâh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Talk to Rísti Graver","Rísti Graver, the greatest foreman of the Ironfold, has learned the location of the sacred Jewel of Abnâh. While the jewel has been found, it will take a skilled hero to recover it and return it to the throne! You should seek out Rísti Graver as soon as you are able.","Defeat Nakhauga","Defeated Nakhauga","The sacred Jewel of Abnâh has been found.","Retrieved the Jewel of Abnâh","Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Abnâh","Rísti Graver can be found at Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Retrieve the Jewel of Abnâh","Summon Nakhauga","Nakhauga can be found in Deepscrave.\
\
You should collect the Jewel of Abnâh from Nakhauga.","Added the Jewel of Abnâh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","The greedy Orc attacks!"},
[14812]={"Added the Jewel of Adnâkh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","'You have restored the Jewel of Adnâkh to its proper place! You did clean away the muck from it before setting it in the throne, I hope? Ah, I see it shining brightly there, of course you did.\
\
'This jewel represents nature, not just the natural environment in which wild things grow but also the natural state of all beings, ${PLAYER}. It is the nature of the dwarves to persevere, and so we will, until all of Gundabad is made safe from our enemies. The light that shines from the Jewel of Adnâkh will remind us who we are and who we remain as we explore the deep places beneath Gundabad, and that is good.'","Collected the Jewel of Adnâkh","Collect the Jewel of Adnâkh","Sift through one last pile of muck","Sift through the piles of muck (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sifted through piles of muck (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Talk to Rísti Graver","Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Adnâkh","The sacred Jewel of Adnâkh has been found.","Rísti Graver can be found at Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Piles of muck can be found in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You should sift through one last pile of muck for the Jewel of Adnâkh.","The Jewel of Adnâkh can be found in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You should collect the Jewel of Adnâkh.","'Word has reached us here at the Steepset that the sacred Jewel of Adnâkh was recently dredged up in Gloomingtarn, unbeknownst to the goblins doing the dredging! I ask you to locate the jewel and retrieve it before the sacred stone becomes lost once more!'","Rísti Graver, the greatest foreman of the Ironfold, has learned the location of the sacred Jewel of Adnâkh. While the jewel has been found, it will take a skilled hero to recover it and return it to the throne! You should seek out Rísti Graver as soon as you are able.","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should add the Jewel of Adnâkh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","Piles of muck can be found in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You should sift through the muck for the Jewel of Adnâkh.","Add the Jewel of Adnâkh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Something nearby catches your eye!"},
[14813]={"Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Amad","'The sacred Jewel of Amad has been found upon the Drearspire, guarded by the evil sorcerer, Olcrith. I ask you to retrieve it, if you can survive his evil magic and wrest the gem from him.'","Add the Jewel of Amad to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Defeated Olcrith","Locate the Jewel of Amad in Câr Bronach","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should add the Jewel of Amad to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Talk to Rísti Graver","Retrieved the Jewel of Amad","Added the Jewel of Amad to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Defeat Olcrith","The sacred Jewel of Amad has been found.","Retrieve the Jewel of Amad","'Thank you for braving the fell sorceries of the Angmarim cultists at the Drearspire, for without such courage you could not have recovered the Jewel of Amad!\
\
'The violet light of this stone dances upon the walls and fills me with the need to keep it from harm, and why should it not? The Jewel of Amad symbolizes compulsion, but I daresay that is not always a negative force. Why, I declare that compulsion can also be a force for good! Consider the drive of the dwarves, who will not rest until the Mountain-home has been fully reclaimed! In the light of the Jewel of Amad, I say that is a positive good, and should be celebrated.\
\
'Thank you again, my friend.'","The Jewel of Amad can be found in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should locate the Jewel of Amad.","The sorcerer approaches!","The Jewel of Amad can be found in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should retrieve the Jewel of Amad.","Summon Olcrith","The Jewel of Amad is encased within an evil barrier!","Olcrith can be found in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should defeat Olcrith to get the Jewel of Amad.","Rísti Graver, the greatest foreman of the Ironfold, has learned the location of the sacred Jewel of Amad. While the jewel has been found, it will take a skilled hero to recover it and return it to the throne! You should seek out Rísti Graver as soon as you are able."},
[14814]={"The Jewel of Amnâd can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should collect the Jewel of Amnâd.","Added the Jewel of Amnâd to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","'I thank you for retrieving the Jewel of Amnâd, one of the seven sacred jewels of Zidir-nesad. I have been researching the jewel since its discovery, but to see it restored fills me with a feeling of triumph I can hardly explain, even to you.\
\
'Behold its light green radiance! This gem symbolizes the will of the dwarves to achieve whatever they set their minds and muscles to accomplish... let it be a sign to all those who struggle against overwhelming odds, and give them the strength to persevere! The return of this jewel shall undoubtedly give us the will to continue our quest and see the Mountain-home reclaimed.'","The Jewel of Amnâd can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should find a way to get to the Jewel of Amnâd.","The lever mechanism reveals a set of precarious platforms on the structure above!","Find a way to get to the Jewel of Amnâd","Collect the Jewel of Amnâd","Collected the Jewel of Amnâd","Talk to Rísti Graver","Rísti Graver, the greatest foreman of the Ironfold, has learned the location of the sacred Jewel of Amnâd. While the jewel has been found, it will take a skilled hero to recover it and return it to the throne! You should seek out Rísti Graver as soon as you are able.","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should add the Jewel of Amnâd to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","The sacred Jewel of Amnâd has been found.","'The sacred Jewel of Amnâd! It has been found, right here in Máttugard, but no one can say how to reach it! I ask you to find a way to retrieve it.'","Add the Jewel of Amnâd to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Amnâd","Rísti Graver can be found at Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver."},
[14815]={"Find Vílur Strayfoot","'The sacred Jewel of Maral had been recovered by Vílur Strayfoot in Clovengap, but Vílur got himself captured before he could return to safe places with it! I ask you to assist in the safe returns of both Vílur Strayfoot and the Jewel of Maral.'","Add the Jewel of Maral to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Talk to Vílur Strayfoot","Vílur Strayfoot can be found somewhere in Clovengap.\
\
You should find Vílur Strayfoot.","Rísti Graver, the greatest foreman of the Ironfold, has learned the location of the sacred Jewel of Maral. While the jewel has been found, it will take a skilled hero to recover it and return it to the throne! You should seek out Rísti Graver as soon as you are able.","Collect the Jewel of Maral","'You found the Jewel of Maral, and more importantly you were able to bring it safely back here, which must be more difficult than it appears, for Vílur Strayfoot was not able to accomplish that himself!\
\
'The Jewel of Maral symbolizes passion, and for the dwarves I know it is a passion of the earth, and of stone, and of the deep places in which treasure can be found. So too is it the passion that drives us to do our very best in all things, and to strive against deadly threats that, once overcome, will delight the listener with tales of the triumph against them! Many such tales have come from the reclamation of Gundabad, and more such are sure to be on the way!\
\
'Thank you again, my friend.'","Collected the Jewel of Maral","Vílur has given you a map to the Jewel of Maral","The Jewel of Maral can be found in Clovengap.\
\
You should collect the Jewel of Maral.","The sacred Jewel of Maral has been found.","Vílur has been captured and needs rescuing!","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Talk to Rísti Graver","Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Maral","Aid Vílur Strayfoot","'Thank you again for the rescue! Ah yes, the jewel I was telling you about.... Oh, I see. You are already aware of it! I do not have it upon my person, however. I did have it in my possession but had to quickly hide it when I spotted my captors encircling me. Do not worry, I remember where I left it! I will draw you a map. Just give me a moment....'\
\
Vílur Strayfoot hands you a crude map with just enough information upon it to find where he hid the jewel.\
\
'Here you are.... Now that I am free of danger I will be able to make it to the nearest outpost on my own. Good luck and thanks again!'","Vílur Strayfoot can be found in Clovengap.\
\
You should talk to Vílur Strayfoot now that he is safe again.","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should add the Jewel of Maral to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Added the Jewel of Maral to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","'I was ambushed, again! Thank you for finding me! Let us hastily retreat and then I will tell you of the jewel I found!'","Vílur Strayfoot can be found in Clovengap.\
\
You should escort Vílur Strayfoot to safety."},
[14816]={"The Jewel of Masal may be found somewhere in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should seek out the plaque referencing the Jewel of Masal.","You discover a plaque bearing the name of the jewel","Rísti Graver, the greatest foreman of the Ironfold, has learned the location of the sacred Jewel of Masal. While the jewel has been found, it will take a skilled hero to recover it and return it to the throne! You should seek out Rísti Graver as soon as you are able.","You have found a plaque bearing the name of the Jewel of Masal. The Plaque of Masal contains only the name of the jewel and a small indentation in the shape of a jewel.","Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Masal","The Plaque of Masal can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should examine the Plaque of Masal.","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","The sacred Jewel of Masal has been found.","Examine the Plaque of Masal","Talk to Rísti Graver","Seek out the Plaque of Masal","'I have learned of a clue to the location of the sacred Jewel of Masal! Its name has been found, inscribed upon a plaque within the Pit of Stonejaws. Many have searched, but no one knows what the plaque means or where the jewel is located! I ask you to try your hand at locating the jewel, my friend.'"},
[14817]={"'You have my thanks for retrieving the Jewel of Masal, which lay hidden behind riddles no others were able to solve!\
\
'This light-blue jewel symbolizes the good fortune of the dwarves and of all those who seek prosperity in Gundabad. But it reminds us too that chance can be fleeting, and we must appreciate that which we have when we have it. Let the return of the Jewel of Masal prove that the luck we need to see the Mountain-home reclaimed is of our own making, the result of our own hard work.'","The fifth location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should stand at the fifth location.\
\
'I was there when the first tree fell to build your home.'","Feeling the small indentation in the Plaque of Masal, you discover that it is a very small pressure plate. Pressing down on the indentation reveals seven lines of text upon the plaque. These words must show the way to the jewel's location....\
\
'As you were walking, you got to where you needed to go with me by your side.\
\
'I bear the symbol of your line and kept you safe during the war.\
\
'As chance would have it, I have broken the lines and turned the tides of battle.\
\
'As chance would have it, I have both pierced the skin of the enemy, and sliced an apple for a meal.\
\
'I was there when the first tree fell to build your home.\
\
'I was there when you struck the nails that would hold your home together.\
\
'I have found all that remains just out of your grounded grasp.'","The fourth location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should stand at the fourth location.\
\
'As chance would have it, I have both pierced the skin of the enemy, and sliced an apple for a meal.'","Add the Jewel of Masal to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Collected the Jewel of Masal","Stand at the second location","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should add the Jewel of Masal to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","The sixth location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should stand at the sixth location.\
\
'I was there when you struck the nails that would hold your home together.'","Stand at the seventh location","Stand at the sixth location","Talk to Rísti Graver","The second location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should stand at the second location.\
\
'I bear the symbol of your line and kept you safe during the war.'","Added the Jewel of Masal to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","The first location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should stand at the first location.\
\
'As you were walking, you got to where you needed to go with me by your side.'","Stand at the third location","The final pressure plate locks into place and the jewel is revealed!","The mechanism has reset!","<rgb=#FF0000>Stand on the locations in the correct order</rgb>","The Jewel of Masal can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should collect the Jewel of Masal.","A pressure plate locks into place","The recovery of the sacred Jewel of Masal continues.","Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Masal Recovered","Stand at the fourth location","Stand at the fifth location","Collect the Jewel of Masal","The third location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should stand at the third location.\
\
'As chance would have it, I have broken the lines and turned the tides of battle.'","Stand at the first location","The seventh location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
