\
'I have found all that remains just out of your grounded grasp.'"},
[14818]={"'You return! With my relics in hand no less!'\
\
You hand over the gathered items to Angârmu.\
\
'These are very valuable relics, and it had saddened me to leave them behind when the demons came, but I had no choice.\
\
'I thank you, yes I thank you for bringing them back to me, visitor.'","Gathered a pouch of ritual spices","Angârmu has asked you to help him recover valuable relics within Zikrum-dûl that were left behind when he fled.","Gather a pouch ritual spices","Return to Angârmu with the collected items","Angârmu has asked you to travel to Zikrum-dûl and recover various ancient relics that hold great value.","Gather the ancient relics that Angârmu asked for from Zikrum-dûl.","'Ah, visitor! You must gather relics for me. Relics I thought lost, but they are not.\
\
'You must go. Go to Zikrum-dûl. It is dangerous, far too dangerous for me to travel there myself. But you can go. I need you to go and gather my relics.\
\
'In Zikrum-dûl you must gather for me a bottle of an ancient elixir, a pouch filled with dust that I can use for my rituals, and finally, a small box, yes a box, filled with precious gemstones.\
\
'Go now and bring these back to me, friendly visitor.'","Returned to Angârmu with the collected items","Zikrum-dûl Relic Expedition","Found Zikrum-dûl","Return to Angârmu in Malgâma with the ancient relics gathered from Zikrum-dûl.","Find a flask of ancient elixir","Collected a pouch of precious gems","Found a flask of ancient elixir","Collect a pouch of precious gems","Travel to Zikrum-dûl to search for the ancient relics"},
[14819]={"Destroyed weapon racks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy weapon racks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed many supplies and weapon racks at Zudramdân.","When conflict broke out, Zudramdân was the first hold to be lost to the Orkish forces of Gundabad. The once dwarf-held outpost has now fallen into the hands of Orc warriors. The forces at Zudramdân are sure to fortify their defences, unless something can be done to dwindle their stores.","You have destroyed many supplies and weapon racks at Zudramdân, thwarting the Orc efforts to fortify the ruins. Those in the war effort will be grateful for all that you have done here.","Destroy supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Supplies and weapon racks can be found in and near Zudramdân.\
\
You should destroy supplies and weapon racks.","When conflict broke out, Zudramdân was the first hold to be lost to the Orkish forces of Gundabad.","Zudramdân: Enemy Stores","Zudramdân was destroyed by a nearby siege encampment","Completado","Destroy supplies and weapon racks"},
[14820]={"'Te doy la bienvenida, ${PLAYER}. Entonces, Simbi te envió aquí, ¿eh? Entonces no debe gustarte mucho...\
\
'¡No! ¡No! ¡Solo era una broma! Es un poco húmedo aquí abajo, pero te acostumbras, siempre y cuando puedas mantener el moho fuera de tu barba.\
\
'He estado estudiando a las criaturas de Moria desde que llegué aquí, tanto como puedo sin ser devorado por ellas, y he aprendido algunas cosas. Si quieres ayudarme, estoy seguro de que podemos descubrir sus secretos.'","'Ve a ver a Águti en la Bodega Putrefacta.'","Simbi cree que Aguti, un amigo suyo, podría tener información interesante sobre el progreso de la expedición en las Obras Hidráulicas.","'¿Tienes tiempo para ayudar a la expedición de nuevo? Me gustaría que hablaras con un amigo mío, Águti. Ha viajado más profundo en Moria con la expedición, y aún no he tenido noticias de él.\
\
'Puedes encontrar a Águti en las antiguas Obras Hidráulicas, en un lugar que llamamos la Bodega Putrefacta, al suroeste de aquí, más allá de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
'Me han dicho que no se considera el puesto más cómodo...'","Águti se encuentra en el campamento de la Bodega Putrefacta en las Obras Hidráulicas, al suroeste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Simbi te ha pedido que hables con Águti para preguntarle sobre el progreso de la expedición en las Obras Hidráulicas.","Habla con Águti en el campamento de la Bodega Putrefacta","El consejo de Águti"},
[14822]={"Óinsbridge: Exotic Arms","Óinsbridge stands where the Forest River snakes into Mirkwood at the edge of the Thornholt,. A once-mighty span that has crumbled to a precipitous and treacherous skeleton athwart the water, now under siege by the regrouping Ungoledain.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Óinsbridge: Scurrying Spiders to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gather Ungoladan-weapons.","You gathered Ungoladan-weapons.","Collect Ungoladan-weapons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Collected Ungoladan-weapons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14823]={"Defeat Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge.","Óinsbridge stands where the Forest River snakes into Mirkwood at the edge of the Thornholt,. A once-mighty span that has crumbled to a precipitous and treacherous skeleton athwart the water, now under siege by the regrouping Ungoledain.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Óinsbridge: Scurrying Spiders to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge have been defeated.","Defeated Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Óinsbridge: Infestation","Completado","Defeat Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14824]={"'Remember how I was afraid of that wizard in the woods? Well I tell you those woods are no good! Apparently those spider-folk are back and they're very upset! I can't possibly retrieve resources in Óinsbridge knowing they're around!\
\
'We need to drive them out of Óinsbridge! Are you... well, will you go do it?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeat Helghúr","Talk to Stráhek the Stout","You ran out of time...","Óinsbridge stands where the Forest River snakes into Mirkwood at the edge of the Thornholt,. A once-mighty span that has crumbled to a precipitous and treacherous skeleton athwart the water, now under siege by the regrouping Ungoledain.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","'Could you leave as soon as possible? The Ungoledain pose a great threat to Óinsbridge.'","'You have dealt a significant blow to the Ungoledain once again, ${PLAYER}. Their numbers have been weakened... for now.'","Defeat Helghúr in Óinsbridge.","Defeated Helghúr","Óinsbridge: Scurrying Spiders","You should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your victory at Óinsbridge."},
